job showing average joe kind way that has made his mistakes yet still trying live claremont ladies believe that they provided much needed heart the story they weren just people who are out getting money buy bentley these were real people who had real problem and they sought others mean accomplish that goal you could empathize with them because them this child illness was problem with other solution these characters were supposed show real people who are less fortunate who got into this mess because they needed help the mobsters they made the story seem sinister way that only the mob can and really liked that part they also padded the story with small intricacies that made the plot that much more interesting christopher walken 90210 guys they provided the comic relief otherwise very serious movie from walken awkward statements the ceaseless references the 90210 guys being has beens their involvement the movie only made that much more enjoyable cinematography yes the cinematography this where this movie seems have lost lot potential fans but opinion thought was genius the use the camera translate the mood the current situation was extremely effective opinion considered method that was properly realized but could always use improvement just like anything else both applaud and congratulate scott the editor the cinematographer and the director photography taking some real chances with this movie not only did they far and above with its presentation they went that much further the use colors both extremely light and extremely dark provided the look the film with sinister and grungy look that accurately depicts the life the mob bounty hunters and the less fortunate manner that show that their life isn peachy clean everyone else you notice times less stress conflict there were very few camera tricks any all this shows that scott and his crew were trying achieve something with this look and weren just doing for the heck realize that most people who watched this movie weren expecting and cause many them turned off this film but think was great that scott took this approach hollywood films have grown predictable and bland most them are shot the same manner with the same twists and turns and glad that scott tried make something different granted this movie isn for everyone but say trash and has nothing offer completely missing the point thoroughly enjoyed this film and glad that spent the money for would recommend this all but sure will only hit chord with few must agree with earlier poster when said that many those who refuse see outside the sphere mtv won appreciate this movie but think many people will should all try enjoy for the fact that scott and took some chances and tried deliver something that was different and unique and with that mind think succeeded tremendously
