1 |text iran women are not permitted attend men sporting events apparently protect them from all the cursing and foul language they might hear emanating from the male fans since men can restrain behave themselves women are forced suffer figure offside tells the tale half dozen young women who dressed like men attempt sneak into the high stakes match between iran and bahrain that 2005 qualified iran the world cup the movie was actually filmed large part during that game offside slice life comedy that will remind you all those great humanistic films the shop main street loves blonde closely watched trains etc that flowed out communist czechoslovakia part the prague miracle the mid 1960 with many those works offside more concerned with observing life than with devising any kind elaborately contrived fictional narrative indeed the simplicity the setup and the naturalism the style that make the movie effective once their ruse discovered the girls are corralled into small pen right outside the stadium where they can hear the raucous cheering emanating from the game inside stuck where they are all they can plead with the security guards let them guards who are basically bumbling good natured lads who are compelled their duty part their compulsory military service even most the men going into the stadium don seem particularly perturbed the thought these women being allowed still the prohibition persists yet how can one not impressed the very real courage and spunk displayed these women they against system that continues enforce such ridiculously regressive and archaic restriction and yet the purpose these women not rally behind cause make point they are simply obsessed fans with burning desire watch soccer game and like all the men the country cheer their team hard tell just how much the dialogue scripted and how much extemporaneous but either case the actors with their marvelously expressive faces magnificent job making each moment seem utterly real and convincing mohammad kheir abadi and shayesteh irani are notable standouts uniformly excellent cast the structure the film also very loose and freeform writer director jafar panahi and writer shadmehr rastin focus for few brief moments one two the characters then move smoothly and effortlessly onto others with this documentary type approach come feel are witnessing actual event unfolding real time very often quite easy for forget actually watching movie was very smart move the part the filmmakers include much good natured humor the film what the czech filmmakers did well the better point the utter absurdity the situation and broaden the appeal the film for audiences both domestic and foreign offside obviously cry for justice but one that made all the more effective its refusal make its story heavy breathing tragedy instead realizes that nothing breaks down social barriers quite efficiently humor and appeal the audience common humanity and isn that what true art supposed all about its own quiet understated way offside one the great under appreciated gems 2007
