eems somewhat bland times but for the most part good enough keep the film least moderately entertaining and sometimes has some good suspense especially later the humour like certain other aspects the film isn good could have been but there are definitely funny moments some them involving francis male ladybug who sometimes mistaken for female you can always expect great animation from pixar and the animation this particular effort theirs exception with all this movie has offer may slightly disappointing when comes pixar standards but reasonable family entertainment
