lly xc2 x97resembled hearst one marion funniest bits often excerpted elsewhere her audition the comet studio casting office while dad helpfully suggests emotions portray sorrow joy and drops handkerchief across her face peggy assumes the appropriate expression and posture she hired only discover that comet makes low brow comedies the kind comedies where people squirt each other with seltzer and inept cops tumble over each other racing the rescue course comet intended take off mack sennett keystone but the true nature the satire becomes clear the story unfolds peggy pepper rises the movie star hierarchy she leaves comet for the more prestigious high art studio assuming the name patricia peppoire more befitting her new station life serious actress some point may occur surely did viewers 1928 that davies rival gloria swanson started out keystone comedies before rising prominence serious dramas for cecil demille and miss peppoire takes herself more and more seriously giving the high hat treatment former colleagues such lowly comic billy boone davies performance takes element wicked parody seemingly aimed squarely swanson herself this especially notable during interview sequence when miss peppoire spokesman spouts pretentious nonsense while the star delivers spot impersonation swanson suppose this was intended friendly spoof but have wonder how friendly relations were between gloria and marion after this movie was released any event show people delicious treat for buffs who will relish the parade star cameos throughout charlie chaplin contributes nice bit sans makeup and looking quite distinguished eagerly seeking patricia peppoire autograph and show good sportsmanship marion davies herself puts self mocking cameo appearance evening the score for poking fun swanson poking fun herself this silent film that viewers not especially attuned silents might appreciate least those viewers with taste for movies about the movie business show people surely belongs the company such classics sunset boulevard and singin the rain among hollywood most expertly produced enjoyable exercises amused self examination
