ovy music that coming out little dinky boom box while trailing trailer load slutty girls who are leaning out the windows and showing off their chests can someone say zombie food also have sub plot involving girl and her boyfriend driving car who stop inspect group birds lying the road the same birds that were infected the zombie smoke the birds attack the boyfriend and the girl drives off deserted gas station seek water this one the most incredibly hilarious moments the movie she walks around this old dirty rusty and obviously abandoned building where she continues ask aloud hello there anyone here please just need some water she encounters group zombies one which chained wall and the other swinging machete after bit rumbling and tumbling around the ground she escapes but not before blowing the gas station with her lighter meanwhile the birds attack the trailer load whores and one girl gets pecked and infected they all pull the same motel where the original infection took place and this where the second most hilarious moment the film takes place after matter hours day the most the same motel now caked dust has vines growing throughout and looks like has been sitting derelict for years anyway what better place take refuge than this particular building needless say the group begins break down several people walk off together get themselves stuck incredibly stupid situation involving zombie attack the third most hilarious moment concerns man and woman who explore deserted village which the woman comments this place dump she then proceeds get pushed off balcony zombie into pirahna infested water where she has her legs bitten off and turns into zombie within seconds meanwhile her friend back the motel who got pecked and infected hours earlier still turning into zombie unfortunately there are just too many inconsistencies this movie that makes this movie just too stupid for words for example the time rate concerning infected people being zombified differs greatly sometime