 shock him one thing that distinguishes cypher from cube how much more polished where cube was confined minimalist setting and shoestring budget with cast unknowns cypher also low budget but natali economises much can allowing him broaden the horizon and launching morgan amazing journey through the labyrinth his own identity natali direction exceptional with deft hand the reins there are some amazing camera angles from above such the enormity the digicorp building vast robust office block conjunction the insignificant speck that morgan standing outside all the colour appears have been bled out the picture which compliments the tone the film perfectly modern day film noir the acting uniformly excellent throughout jeremy northam sympathetic figure from his loveless marriage questioning his own identity his performance excellent because modulated literally seems transform right before our very eyes from clinical spineless wimp confident man who will anything preserve his new identity david hewlett puts welcome appearance who made such impact cube resides secret silo that looks like was borrowed from men black his scene one the best because exercise carefully calculated suspense and paranoia supposed expert identifying double agents and fantastic piece writing brilliantly acted hewlett all has look morgan and drawn into his complex mind game but lucy liu who the scene stealer here too often she cast films where her potential not utilised full effect but cypher she finally given character that fits her like glove rita aloof guarded femme fatale that liu inhabits with relish perked every time she appeared because she always control and can reduce room silence the power her icy stare alone things come very gratifying end that doesn conclude ambiguous note the way cube did but morgan deserves his happy ending after been put through the ringer like this cheered for him the final scene perfect final moment because comes ray sunshine after gloomy minutes cypher succeeds all counts engaging shocking always entertaining everything that total recall wanted but wasn and comes refreshing antidote the overwhelming and inexplicable matrix fine follow from natali and now committed fan the man superb stuff
