1 |text ecstasy 1933 usa 1940 starring hedy lamarr hedy kiesler the world first glimpse year old hedy lamarr occurs the early moments this 1930 treasure she sweeps across the screen angelic wedding gown this was the start legendary career this was our glorious introduction the most beautiful woman ever grace the silver screen eva lamarr wedding night and her older husband seems uninterested her romantic advances she retreats the lonely bed and beautiful scene she fiddles with her wedding ring the realization her marital mistake overcomes her the husband seems more interested neatness and order than does love gustav machaty uses gorgeous camera angles and pristine shot framing capture lamarr considerable talent and beauty with words spoken the early part the film she able grasp our sympathy our hearts and our support that combination that prepared the 1930 audiences for what they were about see the film unfolded ecstasy was considered shocking for its time some thought scandalous she returns home her father estate and files for divorce the next day she wakes with complete sense freedom and happiness she just has outside and feel the freedom the countryside and fresh air eva goes for horseback ride and happens across beautiful lake and one the most famous scenes film history hedy lamarr became the first person ever appear nude major film her frolic the woods and her skinny dipping adventure the lake were legendarily scandalous but the audiences couldn stay away with many today movies the controversy made must see film eva mischievous adventure introduces her handsome young man who helps her find her horse who had run off with her clothes after awkward meeting they eventually fall for each other their first romantic rendezvous was almost controversial the nude scene with its blatant waves eroticism however machaty does beautiful work these romantic moments machaty creates one delightful moment when eva literally seems sink into her new lover using gorgeous early camera trick cannot overstated how brave this performance was lamarr part many might have presumed was career suicide instead gained her worldwide fame and caught the eye louis mayer who signed her contract with mgm there are some truly erotic moments this film even today raunchy standards impossible imagine how they were received the 1930 again machaty was very clever with his imagery leaving lot the imagination but all understand very well what are seeing and supremely well done the meeting eva former husband and her current lover perhaps inevitable however the consequences that meeting are not the film takes few unexpected turns its final act and all makes for great story and lovely debut the grand stage movie stardom for hedy lamarr highly recommend this once controversial now tame film and urge you seek out its restored form dvd easily worthwhile only for the pleasure seeing hedy lamarr but the story compelling too and the direction ahead its time ecstasy memorable early treasure www tccandler com candler movie reviews
