1 |text this one the best animated family films all time moreover virtually all the serious rivals for this title came from the same creative mind hiyao miyazaki and his studio ghibli specifically other great films include neighbor totoro and kikki delivery service spirited away quite good but bit too creepy for typical family fare better for teenagers and adult the one thing that sets laputa castle the sky apart from other films miyazaki that far more tension filled adventure ride why this film good because complete package the animation very well done and the story truly engaging and compelling most japanese anime imaginative but decidedly dark cynical violent and the animation itself often jerky stylized and juvenile none these problems plague castle the sky has imagination burn and the characters are well drawn slightly exaggerated versions realistic people none those trench coat wearing posers there plenty adventure but not blood and gore the animation smooth detailed and cinematic ally composed not lot flat shots the backgrounds are wonderful the voice acting the dubbed english version first rate particularly the two leads pazo james van der beek and sheeta anna paquin the sound engineering great too use your studio sound you got one aspect that particularly enjoyed that much the back story left unexplained laputa was once inhabited and now abandoned why never know know much need know and then just have accept the rest which easy because the invented world fully realized indeed fair say that the world more fully realized than most the minor characters who are for the most part one dimensional stock characters gruff general silly sidekick kooky old miner etc highly recommended for people aged
