1 |text undying very good game which brings some new elements the tired genre first person shoot ups tells the story patrick galloway expert the occult and formidable fighter who summoned friend his estate ireland investigate some weird phainomena the game set ireland after world war one don expect find weapons like chainguns rocket launchers all the weapons the game can considered antiques but the real fun the game are its spells and the system they operate our hero ambidexterous can use both his hands the same time casts spells with his right arm and uses his guns with the left you can shoot and cast spells the same time which you understand very fun and also unique this game the graphics are great and they can run very well medium power level design also cool and atmospheric mostly the game revolves around the covenant estate and the mansion but there are many other locations waiting discovered you progress thanks the talent clyve barker the game has excelent storyline and plot something very rare for first person shooter and said before great and very spooky atmosphere the voice acting also good but not excellent but the game has two main flaws first all quite linear when your mission says for example that room all the doors the house will locked apart from those that lead the room your mission this may save time but restricts your liberty exploration secondly the fact all the weapons are antiques may not appeal most fps players who are used high tech weaponry far difficulty concerned the game very well balanced most medium difficulty but sometimes gets more difficult but not frustratingly difficult overall undying great game definitely one the best fps out there
