1 |text was impressed the beautiful photography this film which was shot location alaska although technically melodrama see lots activities eskimos are involved such hunting dancing building igloos etc and their customs such offering their wives visitors are routinely the story the hunting sequences were sometimes from stock footage was easy recognize some rear projection scenes animals but even these were fascinating spear fishing for salmon hunting for walrus caribou and even polar bear and whale made seem like documentary times there was cast listing which reinforced the documentary flavor the film makers tried make seem very authentic with the natives speaking only eskimo language that was either translated someone screen intertitles the introduction stated that except for the white traders and the royal mounted canadian police there were actors the film but this was not strictly true the two leading characters played mala and lotus long were eskimos birth but were professional actors with credits for earlier films and you could see sometimes they had makeup but they were excellent their roles and they went have hollywood careers all all the film definitely worth look
