1 |text ealing studios television and film production company based west london claims the oldest film studio the world though has been consistently churning out films and television programmes since the 1930s its golden age was most certainly between 1948 and 1955 when produced string comedy masterpieces many starring the great alec guinness such well known titles include whisky galore 1949 passport pimlico 1949 kind hearts and coronets 1949 the lavender hill mob 1951 the titfield thunderbolt 1953 and the ladykillers 1955 one ealing studio most beloved films the man the white suit was released 1951 and starred alec guiness sidney stratton brilliant inventor who engineers remarkable fabric invention that unexpectedly makes him more enemies than friends sidney stratton poor and unappreciated but has scientific talent great abundance due his under qualification the only jobs able get are janitor labourer any the large textile factories where secretly undertakes his own experiments using the company own money and equipment after being found out and ejected countless times sidney convinced that only weeks away from momentous scientific discovery that will revolutionise the textiles industry encouraged his daughter daphne joan greenwood textile mill owner alan birnley cecil parker takes keen interest sidney exploits and agrees finance any further work after numerous failed attempts and quite few earth shattering explosions sidney eventually unveils his amazing creation almost luminous white fabric that never gets dirty and never wears out sidney thought that his invention would make him hero then was sorely disappointed the all powerful bosses textiles industry headed the frail sir john kierlaw ernest thesiger unite ensure that the revolutionary invention which could completely cripple their businesses never goes into full scale production likewise the humble labourers the workers union hear sidney creation and also set out erase from existence fearing for their jobs the inventor however convinced that the ever lasting fabric will bring relief and happiness many and refuses give the demand others despite being threatened with violence and offered xe2 x82 xa4250 000 compensation throughout all his troubles announce his invention the media only one person offers sidney her complete sympathy and support birnley daughter daphne who engaged married somebody else but falls love with sidney plight anyway the man the white suit clever and hilarious comedy made great witty script written john dighton roger macdougall and director alexander mackendrick and quirky and charismatic performance from inimitable alec guinness there are also few good natured swipes capitalism and how big industries can hold back progress for the sake their own monetary situations though can certainly see the arguments for either side the debate
