fe from the sky one day the absolutely perfect person for him right from the very start the film progresses more and more their true adventurous childhood spirit comes out through their kind words and beautifully realistic facial expressions not only are they adorable reminder who used but their endearing friendship never lets throughout the whole film only growing stronger all the way the last frame for that reason fallen love with the two them more than have with any other miyazaki couple the same time castle the sky such easily accessible film because matter what kind casual moviegoer you may you sure find your fix here mystery action drama comedy suspense sci romance even some western all here just about everything people the movies for except maybe horror this why can easily recommend first miyazaki film perfect for those who have expectations from having already seen the incredible otherworldliness some his more recent works even the ending song the film when translated into english conveys the sense longing for the discovery some kind lost civilization and some kind soul mate that could not found our mundane lives the reason long for the many lights that you are there one them the earth spins carrying you carrying both who surely meet miyazaki has always provided poetic lyrics make ending songs out joe hiasashi gorgeous scores but this the only one seen that both touching love song and inspirational dream have found myself near tears just listening castle the sky may not miyazaki most developed spectacular meaningful work but absolutely perfect for what really was meant true vision childhood fantasy and wonderful escape from reality for any adults who wish they could have the same wonderful sense imagination they had when they were just carefree little kids sit back relax and love for what
