1 |text dominick nicky luciano wears hulk shirt and trudges off everyday perform his duties garbage man uses his physical power picking other trash and hauling the town dump reads comic book hero stories and loves wrestlers and wrestling going wrestlemania with his twin brother eugene their birthday yearly tradition talks kindly with the many people comes contact with during his day reads comic books which finds the trash with young boy who often passes while the garbage route unfortunately dominick has diminished ability use his mind has disability dominick disability came result injury the head which suffered traumatic brain injury tbi this injury left him slower though did not change his core characteristic strong individual who helps protect others dominick actually more able live independently than may seem the beginning the film lives with eugene who studying become doctor dominick provides the main source income while eugene off studying eugene must face the fact that continue his education different city and that must move away from dominick eugene also develops romance which begins separate him from his twin brother the film deals specifically with domestic abuse and how this can impact individuals families and then society whole the strain that escalates between eugene and dominick eugene realizes that must eventually leave nicky exploded their birthday night eugene yells dominick and throws him against the wall this moment eugene must confront his own fears being like his abusive father the father which dominick protected him against while himself became the victim the abuse this event cemented the love between the two brothers who from then became the best friends though they needed each other they also both needed independence and the ability grow and develop relationship with others the fact that they must part ways became very real emotional strain however the end the film dominick able say good bye his brother and wish him luck eugene able leave his brother with the confidence that has started make social network people who care about him and will help him with his independence when dominick witnesses the abuse his friend forced come face face with the cause his own trauma this state extreme stress dominick almost completely shuts down then runs after the ambulance the hospital see what happened his friend after learning that the boy has died confronted the abusive father who fearing his testimonial tells him didn see nothing doesn know anything and not say anything and that does will kill him now that his own life has been threatened goes and find the hand gun that larry used kill the rats goes the wake the deceased boy and gunpoint kidnaps the baby the grieving family runs away from the scene and hides building when the police surround him eugene goes the building talk his brother eugene then reveals the cause dominick disability and they bring the baby back the abusive father then wields gun his own threatening kill dominick but eugene stops him and dominick tells the crowd that saw the father throw his son down the stairs through the climactic ending the issue dysfunctional behavior comes into view though dominick instinct save the baby can understood also see how damaging this response dominick put the baby life and his own life grave danger the larger societal consequences these events not directly implicated but rather shown through the films ending despite the more optimistic ending portrayal another sequence events might just have likely occurred which dominick charged with kidnapping and possession firearm somewhat difficult believe that this went completely unaccounted furthermore even dominick not charged there may still stigma against him within the community not that there wasn one before these events instead the film shows that must able recognize problematic behavior and act curb dominick and eugene was released 1988 the same year another film rainman which won academy awards while rainman was achievement and helped increase the visibility with person with disabilities could argued that dominick and eugene holds more valuable lessons for society whereas rainman demonstrated that mainstream american society might able learn from and care for savant the savant the inheritor large estate dominick and eugene show that person with disability might able care for and help save members american society the message independent person with disabilities may have been too strong for 1988 hopefully someday society will see the strengths individuals with disabilities not threat but imperative for the strength society
