ied that just mediocre filmmaking for example the amityville horror which obviously copied much the shining far its subject matter did this but entirely different when film presented way that really makes you think mostly all kubrick movies are one more thing that can all thank stanley kubrick for and should thank him for for not throwing this book against the wall that one toss would have been cinematic tragedy
