e places his hand her shoulder and suddenly she scathed mark her shoulder needless say the mark not good sign what ensues battle for earth battle between both good and evil should but also between good and good itself the point for this film became something other than what thought would came thinking would either fast paced action style film with demons horror film with macabre evil and foul creatures the likes which would seen ringu and was however mistaken the best possible way the story seemed adaptation very old japanese play and plays itself out such combining the essentially action driven adrenaline scenes with great concept amazing narrative and style which makes you compelled think rather than just sit wallowing gore many scenes are painted with luxurious dialogue between two characters the likes which will never seen hollywood film becomes practically theatrical experience which takes your breath away the film makes use some immaculate scenery and camera work comparable many great samurai films our days but adding well thought and classical plot with great acting great music and thoroughly stunning scenes its must watch book that being said does need the disclaimer that not for everyone its not cheap thrills horror its not balls the wall action its horror style play thats been filmed has very much say and takes the time flying the face the conventional one liners like japanese plays the exchanges between the characters can last for many minutes before they come together for quick yet marvelous battle scene you can enjoy such thing this masterpiece your idea good film slasher flicks with little plot and excessive nudity then you can easily watch something else overall this film unique and amazing one which keeps you riveted and amused has good writing good acting and good direction all all solidly great film
