1 |text haven seen the original incredible journey since was child can really compare the two versions this version tells the story three animals two dogs and cat whose owners leave them with friends the countryside when the father the family has take new job san francisco the pets believing that they have been abandoned escape and set out long homeward journey through wilderness this story might have been most easily filmed cartoon but both versions are fact live action films made using real animals one major difference that the later version the animals speak human voices giving each its own distinct personality something that was not done the original film similar device talking animals has been used other recent children films such racing stripes some critics have been rather sniffy about the use this device but own view that giving the animals distinctive personalities their own helps strengthen the film rather than weaken the animals were voiced big name stars don ameche michael fox and sally fields both dogs are male and their relationship parallels that between many humans buddy buddy movies shadow golden retriever the wise experienced older dog chance the younger one brash cocky and impulsive british eyes chance looks like boxer but actually american bulldog which apparently different breed its british cousin sassy the cat female with rather prim and proper personality she very proud her status cat which her eyes makes her vastly superior any mere dog cats rule dogs drool from adult viewpoint the film has number faults can sentimental some the incidents such the one which the animals manage catapult mountain lion into the river are quite incredible and the human characters are all completely forgettable this however film which mainly aimed children and suspect they will enjoy immensely certainly any animal loving child will comments some professional critics such james berardinelli who complained that the animals voices lessened the film grandeur only serve strengthen view that professional critics are not always the best guides children movies doubt many playground conversations about homeward bound concentrated its supposed grandeur one thing adults will appreciate the photography california sierra nevada mountains they may also appreciate the film blend humour and excitement the runaway pets encounter perils such bears mountain lions and porcupines the wilderness this very enjoyable family film
