1 |text 1991 saw the release the two best sequels all time terminator judgment day and bill ted bogus journey out the two always liked bill ted bogus journey bit better terminator judgment day the better made but there just nothing like bill and ted besides chris farley and david spade tommy boy hard think greater comedic duo than bill and ted they are one kind seemingly influenced national lampoon and stiggs bill and ted were created solomon and chris matheson two incredibly talented writers who invented the duo while performing local theater back the 1980s the two quickly began writing screenplay about two and before long bill ted excellent adventure was born the film shot 1987 and released 1989 became big box office success and instant cult classic wasn long before work began the sequel stephen herek the director excellent adventure wasn keen working the sequel since considered too mean spirited and unlike the first one peter hewitt making his feature film debut was brought direct the sequel there couldn have been better director for the job bill ted bogus journey marvelously directed filled with its own unique style and energy that can matched what makes bogus journey one the best sequels ever that while darker than the original just fun doesn change the characters like most sequels bill and ted are the same lovable characters that they were the first film this because was written the original writers most sequels are not written the same writers the first one but since bogus journey had the same screenwriters ended being just good excellent adventure not even better just like the first one bogus journey absolutely hilarious well written fun and above all original filled with spectacular special effects and fantastic comedic performances from alex winter keanu reeves and william sadler unforgettable journey
