1 |text follow the fleet rko production 1936 stars fred astaire and ginger rogers complex romantic comedy although fred astaire and ginger rogers have had many similar romantic movies together rko helped them once again create worth while storyline that incorporates relevant situations society the time was made the narrative follow the fleet relies heavily the use layered story lines between the two sets main characters create satisfying romantic comedy the general plot the movie revolves around bake baker sailor the navy played fred astaire and sherry martin bake former love and dance partner who now singer and dancer played ginger rogers their story begins when bake the ship and his shipmate bilge smith finds photo the two them together and bake reveals that the last time saw her had asked her marry him bilge suggests that they try and meet with her when they are land hopes that she might have friend the next major scene begins the second plot the movie when connie martin sherry sister refused entry into paradise where her sister works unless she escorted gentleman she turns around find bilge behind her with bag full beverages she plays off like she was waiting him and buys his entrance into paradise well connie then finds sherry and tells her that she depressed because she cannot have the luck sherry does with men sherry suggests she get makeover from her friends while she performing stage connie gets made over and enters the ballroom once again and approaches bilge again who awestruck the sight her this commences the second romantic storyline between bilge and connie throughout the remainder the movie the story and rising actions are transitioned between altering comedic reliefs the two couples troubles that create several mini rising and falling actions within the overall plot bake and sherry hit off their first moments together they compete dance competition and end winning reminding them the success and pleasure the two have when they are together similarly bilge able swoon connie through his romantic attempts pleasing her and they retire her house this series happy events soon followed unsettling measures that brings the rising action back down bake left sherry the previous night retire the ship before midnight and told her that would come for her the morning unfortunately the ship sets course after the shipmates have returned upsetting sherry and leaving her think bake was still being typical sailor looking for good time when land the mood again changed another subplot entered into the film when party big shots taking tour the ship this alternate storyline used create buffer between the stories the two main relationships the film well help build confidence and fondness bake overall good intentions the party interrupted the oblivious music playing coming from bake and his companions when they missed the sounding report deck for the company the ladies are intrigued and ask hear them play and bake gladly begins entertain them with some dancing which ultimately helps brighten the mood the film well bring happiness the sailors after returning the couple intertwined stories sherry trying prove bake that she does not need his help with landing job unfortunately bake unaware that she auditioning and goes put good word for sherry when overhears his friend the studio talking about the remarkable lady auditioning bake takes upon himself help sherry out tampering with her water making her unable sing correctly and destroying her audition addition bake mistake connie spent all her money repair ship that she was hoping bilge would take over captain she had also planned remarkable dinner date for him when was supposed come over but bilge was aware her intentions and hopes soon marrying and was longer interested stood her the remainder the movie continues the same format mini rising and falling actions until the climactic point reached between the two couples ending the movie with the happiness both couples the use the altering stories helps build interest and emotion within each couple they deal with both happiness and pain through each their struggles the intertwining stories are also able relate with one another well incorporate other unrelated subplots help carry the narrative through the concluding scenes although fred astaire and ginger rogers have countless films together that incorporate romance comedy song and dance follow the fleet unique film for the two actors that successfully use the technique subplots aid the narrative between the two main characters
