 winter cold the acting certainly contributes this ultra realism with both voight and hoffman masterfully portraying the two decadent dregs modern society hoffman particular exceptional his role walkin here walkin here managing steer well clear being typecast after his much lauded debut 1967 the graduate both stars were later nominated for best actor oscars also nominated for acting xc2 x96 bafflingly xc2 x96 was sylvia miles for appearance that can have been for more than five minutes though both ultimately lost out john wayne true grit midnight cowboy eventually went win three oscars from seven nominations including best picture best director for schlesinger and best writing for waldo salt midnight cowboy told mainly linear fashion though there are numerous flashbacks that hint joe past rather than explicitly explaining what these brief snippets are actually about the audience invited think about for themselves and how these circumstances could have led joe onto the path now pursuing the achingly beautiful final scene leaves with glimmer hope but large amount uncertainty gritty thought provoking and intensely fascinating midnight cowboy one for the ages
