n long forgotten except those involved one side the other and anderson has completed his state the country trilogy effect whatsoever any chance you should wish read book about schoolboys who did buck the system rather more successfully than mcdowell and his friends and furthermore lived tell the tale find copy stalky written the man whose much maligned poem lent name anderson film man born colonial india man whose work quietly being airbrushed out our literary history and before the chattering classes succeed declaring him non person perhaps somebody should start revolution about that
