1 |text wwe was need saviour wrestlemania rolled around the departure bret hart and subsequent evaporation the hart foundation had left the vile generation stable unchallenged the wwe their despicable leader shawn michaels had stolen the title from hart thanks the interference vince mcmahon and with help from his cohorts triple and chyna had systematically taken out anyone who challenged his supremacy but the royal rumble new contender had emerged stone cold steve austin hated mcmahonagement austin had worried worried fact that they enlisted the help the baddest man the planet mike tyson special enforcer austin would have the odds firmly against him his title match with shawn michaels but first there was undercard get through which kicked off with the legion doom winning forgettable team battle royal become contenders for the tag titles actually forgotten this match existed until rewatched the ppv very good and really highlighted the lack depth the tag division that period time next match saw the light heavyweight title defended champion taka michonoku against aguila the wwe had established the light heavyweight title compete with the strong cruiserweight division wcw was not successful and this was the only time the title was ever defended wrestlemania short match going about five minutes and fact too short for much achieved what little they did was exciting and this was nice little match which saw taka retaining his title our next match saw member triple defending the wwe european title which won farcical fashion from shawn michaels raw december and hadn defended ppv against owen hart the sole survivor triple got big entrance with the band there perform his theme song chyna accompanied triple ringside but was then handcuffed wwe commissioner sgt slaughter triple and owen have nice little match before chyna interfered causing low blow hart which leads triple retaining the title good match could have been great had gone slightly longer but course wouldn want take time away from our next match which saw real life husband and wife marc mero and sable defeat goldust and luna vachon the first mixed tag match wrestlemania years and all honesty wasn worth the wait while not terrible the match was way memorable either this was the nearing the end mero only run the wwe and the main purpose was continue the disintegration his relationship with sable next saw ken shamrock flip out and cost himself the intercontinental championship destroyed champion the rock but then refused let his ankle lock submission hold resulting the referee reversing his decision this was short match but decent for what was next saw the first good match the night wwe tag team champions the new age outlaws lost their titles cactus jack and chainsaw charlie fun dumpster match the decision was overturned the following night cactus and chainsaw had thrown the outlaws into dumpster backstage rather than the one being used the match but this was still fun match now was time for the highly anticipated first ever meeting between kane and his brother the undertaker kane had cost undertaker the wwe championship the royal rumble and then killed him when helped shawn michaels lock undertaker casket and set him fire revenge for the undertaker burning down their parents house and leaving him horribly disfigured years before this was decent match and told nice story the underataker absorbed everything kane could throw him and then knocked him out with three tombstones end the match this left only the main event which saw wwe champion face steve austin with mike tyson the guest enforcer michaels had suffered debilitating back injury his match with the undertaker the royal rumble and was remarkable this match despite his physical limitations triple and chyna were banished the back the early going after interfering from the outside the match ended with austin ducking attempt sweet chin music and hitting the stone cold stunner with the ref down tyson then came into the ring count the three celebrating the win with austin and then knocking out michaels after the match turned out tyson and austin were together and the cat had been playing with the mouse all along that was the final ppv match for shawn michaels for four and half years helped establish austin the biggest star the wrestling business and the mainstream publicity garnered tyson appearance proved crucial turning point the wwe battle with wcw austin would become the biggest star wwe history and along with the rock mick foley the undertaker and triple lead the wwe through the period where they would gain their highest level cultural relevance and all started here wrestlemania
