1 |text although the movie clearly dated audiences can still easily identify with the plight hapless buster this timeless and very funny underdog tale buster fights against unkindly odds three different ages the stone age the roman age and the moden age playing almost the same character with just change scenery help identify the different ages this movie see one the earliest comedic depictions the caveman stereotype who wins his love not romance but brute force well funny twist roman gladiatorial combat two comedic sketches that long predate such spoofs mel brooks history the world part the underlying theme the movie simple yet convincing although the times may have changed still face the same struggles even modern times that fought prehistoric times order win the girl keep mind this the theme 1923 america time when chauvinism was still vogue interesting look this movie over eighty years later and consider how dramatically things have changed from this movie modern times now
