1 |text sunday july 1997 the first episode new science fiction series called stargate was broadcast showtime spin off and sequel the 1994 film stargate starring kurt russell and james spader the series begins approximately one year after the events portrayed the film for ten seasons chronicled the adventures and misadventures intrepid team explorers known originally the series starred richard dean anderson colonel jack neill two michael shanks daniel jackson amanda tapping captain samantha carter christopher judge teal and don davis major general george hammond for ten long years watched the team battle against the goa uld the replicators the ori and many other aggressors the same time they forged alliances with the asgard the tok the rebel jaffa the nox and the tollan they saved the world less than eight times over the years and never gave not until death claimed them and sometimes not even then with all long running series they were numerous cast changes michael shanks left the series january 2002 the end its fifth season order broaden his horizons actor daniel jackson successor the team resident archaeologist geek was jonas quinn alien from country called kelowna the planet langara played corin nemec however shanks returned the beginning the seventh season june 2003 and nemec left the same time unfortunately made only one further guest appearance and his character was seldom mentioned afterwards don davis left the series the end the seventh season march 2004 felt that was time for him the show original star and arguably its most popular actor richard dean anderson starred the series throughout its first eight seasons his participation the seventh and eight seasons was noticeably less than the earlier seasons finally left march 2005 order spend more time with his then six year old daughter jack neill was far favourite character the series and truth told never enjoyed the last two seasons much did the earlier episodes for that very reason the ninth season represented new era for the programme with the departure its lead actor and the defeat the goa uld and the replicators season eight many fans felt the series should out high regardless the series carried for further two years with the ori replacing the goa uld the series main adversaries three new characters were brought fill the gaps were and help usher this invention ben browder came the cocky southern air force pilot colonel cameron mitchell the new leader his farscape star the lovely claudia black began play prominent role the series the vivacious sexy hilarious and certainly extroverted vala mal doran former goa uld host and con artist from another planet recurring guest star during the eighth and ninth seasons she joined the cast full time the beginning its tenth and final season rounding off the cast was the legendary beau bridges major general hank landry the new commander the sgc and old friend jack neill and general hammond for the last two years they starred alongside the faithful michael shanks amanda tapping and christopher judge and became valuable parts and made equally valuable contributions the stargate franchise alas all good things must come end during the initial broadcast the first several episodes season ten ratings dropped considerably resulting cancellation its august 2006 after ten seasons and 214 episodes the dream was finally over march 2007 what began with children the gods ended with unending the series finale made its world premiere sky one britain and ireland before being shown the sci channel the united states june 2007 the ten years that the series was the air amassed legions fans and even eclipsed the science fiction series star trek terms popularity certain countries became the second longest running sci series the world second only doctor who 1963 1989 and the longest running american produced sci series having surpassed the files only few months before ended stargate represents the cornerstone the stargate franchise 2004 its success and popularity led the production spin off series entitled stargate atlantis which was regrettably cancelled after five seasons and 100 episodes august 2008 although plans for another feature film fell through two direct dvd films stargate the ark truth and stargate continuum were released 2008 and more are planned for the not too distant future third live action series stargate universe also due premiere some point next year there was unfortunately animated series stargate infinity which ran only from 2002 2003 but the less said about that the better despite the end and atlantis continuing series the future stargate looks very bright indeed conclusion while stargate has yet gain the same degree popular recognition other major sci television franchises such star trek and doctor who its still relatively new compared those two sci giants and have every confidence that will continue for many many years come
