1 |text frank capra wonders life film keeping the blood pumping through our veins the responsibility hardworking hemo the magnificent the mid 1950 and bell science teamed with famed hollywood director frank capra produce series cbs television science films educate the public about the universe around them far cry from the dreary black white fodder often foisted off young scholars the capra films would both instruct and entertain with lively scripts and eye catching visuals shown technicolor the four films our sun 1956 the strange case the cosmic rays 1957 hemo the magnificent 1957 the unchained goddess 1958 quickly became schoolhouse favorites where they were endlessly shown 16mm format the star the series was frank baxter 1896 1982 affable english professor the university southern california this avuncular pedagogue proved the perfect film instructor genially imparting his audience the sometimes complex facts manner which never made them seem dull boring baxter who won peabody award for his achievements continued making high quality instructional films after the capra quartet were concluded hemo the magnificent which was produced written directed capra relates the story the human heart and blood circulation system using animation and gentle humor film star richard carlson appears the fiction writer energetically helping baxter tell hemo tale movie mavens will recognize sterling holloway part the production crew and the voices marvin miller mel blanc june foray pinto colvig various cartoon characters all uncredited the devotional scripture which begins the film completely tune with the tenor tone the production
