nd also decidedly more dangerous especially when the real hit man lyle from dallas dennis hopper arrives the scene red rock west has some great moments suspense example this the scene which michael makes his escape from wayne bar and also some great performances from its very strong cast nicolas cage expressions are extremely natural and convincing reacts variety situations with anxiety surprise uncertainty and walsh also particularly good deceptive character who always concealing more than actually saying dennis hopper intensely threatening the vicious contract killer role plays with great gusto and lara flynn boyle looks suitably cold and calculating the femme fatale dwight yoakam also provides some good support and moments humour his cameo role nonsense truck driver incredibly red rock west was originally destined denied general cinema release but has justifiably emerged from its modest beginnings eventually recognised the great movie that really
