1 |text paulie sounds like the most saccharine lachrymose and sentimental garbage you could ever find yet actually much better than you might expect the daftness the plot could easily have set the tone for the whole film but actually most other departments the film charming case you wondering paulie parrot bought for little girl with speech difficulties paulie becomes her best friend and goes everywhere with her even sits her shoulder during speech therapy lessons and eventually becomes super intelligent speaker himself however paulie sent away the little girl mother and spends the rest the film trying get from united with her why does this awful sounding film succeed relatively well firstly boasts some interesting and impressive animatronic effects secondly and far more significantly has the courage embrace its ludicrous premise and tells genuinely moving often humourous story without worrying too much about the obvious flaws the storyline thirdly has several surprisingly strong performances including jay mohr wily crook gena rowlands kind old lady and cheech marin yes the dope smoking cheech marin musical immigrant might not classic but paulie sound entertainment for kids all ages
