gy regarding character development and usage perhaps the misfire can attributed frank who the time had just finished working with george lucas what many would agree the most childish episode the original star wars saga the writers were also involved with the great muppet caper will let them off the hook for this spite the fact that script one the most essential pieces film the production also substantially improved here with muppets appearing capable moving ways that were previously beyond them had the story and script been better thought out tmtm might have been least comparable the great muppet caper stands now great answer the question whether muppets write under the influence excrete for that reason gave the muppets take manhattan three out ten two denote its actual quality and bonus for the swedish chef moments without him this film would unwatchable
