1 |text this the true story how three british soldiers escaped from the german prisoner war pow camp stalag luft iii during the second world war this the same pow camp that was the scene for the great escape which resulted the murder captured officers the gestapo and later was made into very successful movie the same name while the other pows stalag luft iii are busy working their three massive tunnels known tom dick harry two enterprising british prisoners came with the idea build wooden vaulting horse which could placed near the compound wire fence shortening the distance they would have tunnel from this starting point freedom the idea build their version the trojan horse came them while they were discussing classic attempts for escape and observing some pows playing leap frog the compound initially containing one and later with two pows hidden inside the wooden horse could carried out into the compound and placed almost the same position near the fence daily basis while volunteer pows vaulted over the horse the escapees were busy inside the horse digging tunnel from under the vaulting horse while positioned near the wire under the wire and into the woods the story also details the dangers that two the three escaping pows faced while traveling through germany and occupied europe after they emerged from the tunnel all three pows who tried escape actually hit home runs escaped successfully their home base the wooden horse gives very accurate and true feeling the tension and events pow breakout the movie was shot the actual locations along the route the two pows traveled their escape made with far less budget than the great escape the wooden horse more realistic not more exciting than the great escape and never fails keep you from the edge your seat rooting for the pows make good their escape the story line crisp and the acting rings true and taut enough keep the tension all the way through the movie the wooden horse based the book the same name one the escapees eric williams and far the best pow escape story ever made into movie some the actual pows were used the movie reprise their existence prisoners stalag luft iii give this movie well deserved ten
