1 |text took couple episodes get into dark angel story and series since were transitioning from the sopranos very different mentality framework but once got with the gist the series were very quickly hooked shame that the series ended just when was just starting past good into the excellent category dark angelwas much more than your average series kicks ass and rocks far action goes but the interactions the characters and societal reactions mutants reminds the constant prejudices that face and make everyday that the story set the future keeps the mood surreal and prevents the anti discrimination message from being rubbed our faces hence not ruining the fun for those who don like lectured during entertainment but every event and human societal interaction remains relevant the present all make judgments face our own prejudices but the end the question who you are lies you sit back and shut your mind you get and something about for those who have choice but fight for survival justice this series empowers them for those who never had face the question this series sneaks that message under the guise pure action entertainment much more well made and well written than most series highly disappointed ended before could really kick into high gear
