ne truly disturbing scene revealing the sex violence obsession but they can seem escape cartoon like artifice and difficult look beyond their seeming one note symphony and find anything other than the obvious ultimately this same raw material could and should used tell this story better fashion alas there really isn much recommend this yet the performances messrs king and zelinas really offer something special and glimpse what might have been and are ultimately worth seeing
