ws the movie recreation the 1930 colorful and elegant look debbie clothes made with very tight budget the increasing atmosphere madness and hysteria genuinely creepy with shocking finale that will haunt you for days and you wouldn easily forget that silly goody goody song that runs through the movie either and seeing increasingly mad shelley winters screw every one debbie reynolds chances happiness hoot watch out
