1 |text this mostly story about the growing relationship between jeff webster jimmy stewart and ronda castle ruth roman she takes instant liking jeff brief encounter the deck the steamer skagway and longer look when hides her cabin while authorities seek him charge murder they find out they have some things common besides animal attraction neither trusts member the opposite sex apparently because both have been married spouses who cheated them gradually they learn trust each other they journey from skagway dawson but ronda clearly has close dealings with corrupt sheriff gannon and engages some shady practices her castle saloon skagway she eventually has decide between gannon and jeff meanwhile rene young naive french woman also takes immediate liking jeff but only gets insulting brush offs return yet she sticks with him his travels from skagway dawson and his activities around dawson along with ronda she nurses him back health after jeff left for dead gannon gunslingers his gold claim walter brennan ben serves jeff long time sidekick doesn have meaty role but serves soften jeff hard edges his demise symbolically opens the door for woman companion replacement for jeff john mcintire sheriff gannon makes probably the most charismatic evil town boss you will ever see film oozing charm and humor along with his bullying evidently sees something himself jeff repeatedly declaring that going like him makes believable incarnation the infamous soapy smith who spent his last years skagway one the premier con men his times jeff the quintessential antihero loner except for companion ben who doesn want stick his neck out for others even when knows the one right man for the job this respect closely resemble burt lancaster character vera cruz for example thus jeff not only turns down the job marshall dawson convinced leave dawson after gannon gang move with clear intentions taking over everyone insufficiently legal gold claims while disposing some miners and suggesting that the rest make hurried exit from dawson even ronda suggests that she and jeff make hurried exit from dawson while they are still alive then jeff has sudden change heart apparently still nursing desire for revenge for the shooting ben and himself changes from anti hero hero leading the expulsion gannon gang from dawson this respect differs from lancaster character who never reforms but jeff truly changed just handing out revenge for wrongs committed against his own interests the main problem see with the plot the principle women clearly ronda groomed the right woman tame jeff although she clearly characterized bad girl jeff has checkered recent past himself having shot least men the yukon and having stolen his cattle back from gannon ironically soon after jeff changes from anti hero hero rhonda makes similar change running into the street warn jeff gannon impending ambush she dies result and jeff asks her why she didn just look out for herself his supposedly just abandoned creed clear that corine calvert renee just doesn make credible substitute for the dead ronda jeff mind yet the apparent implication the parting scene that they get together even though jeff never visibly gives her kiss hug her image good naive young woman somewhat compromised her job rhonda saloon bumping miners weighting their gold dust pushing the spilled dust the floor and recovering later also very unclear about her relationship with rube morris middle aged miner who followers her around and works claim with her not her father another problem the amateurish handling the gun fight between jeff and gannon gang gannon had any skill all with pistol should have killed seriously wounded jeff under that boardwalk before jeff did the same him and how did jeff badly shot right hand suddenly become well enough shoot pistol with apparent ease also wonder what jeff and friends did help save the avalanche victims they were much too far away pull them out alive from under the snow and why weren most ronda pack horses and mules also buried the avalanche you will see host probably nameless but familiar faces among the miners and gannon gang the sequences shot the canadian rockies provide breathtaking backdrop the action all all very entertaining western with most the major flaws concentrated the end doubt this film takes some great liberties with history and geography especially the part taking place the canadian yukon which was fact much tamer than the skagway
