hat the baron and ivanna about this well they get married course during the very brief marriage ceremony the baron shot one the angry locals father one the dead girls but all this doesn deter ivanna who amidst all the dead young ladies and torture surrounding them cheerfully comforts the hurt baron that just flesh wound and the two can and enjoy their honeymoon the castle where the killer rapist torturer brother the whole thing quickly devolves into nightmarish love triangle sorts between ivana the baron and igor blame all love anyway you get the idea subtle not almost everything over the top ridiculous this film and when not ott such the predictable climax things get tad boring but for most the film the director writer revel one illogically trashy moment after another really love these kind films everything subtle being hit over the head with sledgehammer and populated characters behaving illogically even those who made the retromedia dvd realize this and when you the scene selection section hear one the funniest bits dialogue from the dubbed movie looped endlessly the production values are beautifully risible the opening and closing credits with those candles and red curtains soup xc3 xa7on class the music sounds sometimes like something from tim burton film which only adds the oddness all and customary these kind films when the young ladies take off their clothes they just beg killed standard film rate this but bad good film rate solid stars you enjoy trashy films please watch this one must see the only thing left for ponder about what would have taken for that woman get out that freaking castle
