l dance 1937 astaire attempts break free from his typical rich man about town persona without much success but hard imagine the performer without the boyish carefree charm that could only accompany being considerably wealthy the side plot the romance between connie and bilge works well with the antics the two main stars and harriet hilliard wearing brunette wig avoid clashing with ginger blonde hair has couple emotional solo numbers including get thee behind satan which was originally written for top hat
