1 |text domino has been widely condemned this site for its frenetic editing style and sickening photography detractors cite its superficiality and criticize its deployment style over substance couldn disagree more believe that domino represents the absolute height tony scott film making career after having created the dominant hollywood action movie style throughout the late eighties and early nineties tony scott has moved progressively closer more subjective style cinema early crimson tide scott used his stylistic talent portray the inner worlds his characters the claustrophobia and drama inherent the conflict board nuclear submarine was embodied the excellent use long lenses combined with dutched angle framing this was then carried through enemy the state and spy game which visually represented the worlds surveillance and espionage respectively man fire was extreme departure move into expressionist more painterly aesthetic here scott used antiquated hand cranked camera and flash frames express his character explosive rage although not entirely successful introduced the techniques which were find their full expression domino couched the framing device fbi interrogation domino presents the life the infamous bounty hunter via her narrated disjointed fragments memory she grasps memories all fragments flashes and brief snatches domino relays her story verbally scott relays visually illustrating not only the events which she describes but also the point view which guides them she does have traces mescaline her system but her individual vision anyway unusual that woman who eschewed the life luxury for bounty hunting when domino begins relate the events which lead her captivity that scott really lets rip together with cinematographer dan mindel and composer harry gregson williams scott orchestrates postmodern canvas contemporary americana gradually begin realize that unusual though she may domino more disjointed than the 90210 culture she has rejected she wades through this cultural melange scott makes his viewer more aware the innocence which destroys through the underprivileged children which the narrative introduces ultimately scott portrays their salvation the only escape have from this surreal trip criticize this movie for being overly stylized akin criticizing picasso pollock for not representing that which recognizably human like any great painting the meaning domino the surface and the surface everything not any way associated with scott free but have always been and will continue huge admirer tony scott work
