ee what the animators used for everything from the ice cube trays circus stands the animal crackers box circus wagon xc2 x97complete with full nutrition guide the side xc2 x97and crazy compilation boxes create times square billboards and facades everything done right far much the humor you have credit the acting talent for wonderful delivery and inspired role choices one could male ladybug better than dennis leary with his acerbic wit dare you think someone better our leads are great too with dave foley flick and julia louis dreyfus princess atta well the always fantastic kevin spacey hopper spacey not only steals many scenes from the movie but also takes center stage the bloopers during the credits yes bug life was the originator animated outtakes from pixar tradition that has continued with many tongue cheek bug jokes laced throughout you also have give props the huge supporting cast full those guy actors people like richard kind brad garrett and the late joe ranft heimlich the worm who bring the biggest laughs overall may the simplest story brought screen pixar one that has been told one form the other numerous times over the years but inspired enough and fresh enough deliver enjoyable experience there are joyous moments sad times and even action packed scenes suspense with birds coming join the fun complete with couple favorite pixar characters tuck and roll there isn too much bad that can think saying about
