ife giving sanity chaos not the creative chaos staid order parker posey excellent actress who captures hal hartley tongue cheek humor perfectly elina xc3 xb6wensohn perhaps eclipses her emotional commitment the role allowing parker play both straight man and comic against the lively stage like comedy happening around her with the entrance henry into the picture the movie begins take sobering turn hal hartley movies are all plays and every play must come full circle the end you are shown fay newly developed character and integrity are the offspring her time with the fatally intense henry whose piercing honesty and unique passion lights spark anyone meets fay grim excellent movie which does not surpass henry fool but shows through hal range that the nuances his art are the proof his genius honestly think anyone who bashes this movie not only missed the point mile and especially the subtlety parker posey acting but could not have been much interested the movie henry fool
