ood but not anything unusual today standards many viewers will debate back and forth about the quality this new show but will not forgive scifi and ron moore for destroying our dream that being said shall offer some comments about the merits this new mini itself not comparison the original the battle sequences were the best part effort was obviously put into making the effects more real appearance and less wow look that effect would not say these sequences were exceptional today standards yet they were keeping with made for cable original movies what was the deal with this pseudo live cam some views tried fake the effect real camera with lagging tracking and jerky zooms however was over used considering there was apparent source these cameras the infinitely more intelligent series babylon the only instance seen such live cams used effectively when were supposedly witnessing action from security cams the script you ask the script felt like was written teenager for other teenagers the characters felt cardboard and stereotypical indeed the whole story felt pieced together from other well known stereotypes the only good features the entire story were those few elements which were preserved from the original series was obviously dumbed down for digestion your average audience the human interaction was pitiful rather than drama based subtle looks expressions and fine timing every moment human tension was exaggerated the point being obvious they lost all ability move any refined viewer such was obvious any interaction between adama and son the director must have been trying make sure the most dense and unfeeling viewer wouldn miss even not paying attention sorry but real humans don behave like the continually wouldn have considered this bad show had stood its own nothing great will never revered true scifi fans artisans but would watchable the masses personally could have lived without though only watched see how really did capture the spirit the original how this mini series will always remembered symbol how quality storytelling has been cast aside appeal greater numbers how even scifi channel has dumbed down its productions cater the masses opposed its true niche market the science fiction fans will the time asked for steak and they insisted giving chicken despite our complaints leave you with only one thought moore
