1 |text this cartoon short plot but visually stunning piece work there will very very minor spoilers this short has story that incredibly slight gnomes underground are responsible for the return spring each year yet must contend with winter not yet ready withdraw both the gnomes and the storm have their own songs that pretty much the plot such but this cartoon isn about the plot about the color and animation the visuals are exceptional back 1936 such bright color was still something novelty and there some incredibly inspired work here favorite moments the short surround the movement the liquefied colors through pipes more than one point there are series pipes aligned row from the shortest the tallest and the colors move through the pipes and the musical track makes seem though the row pipe organ the visuals the battle between the emerging greenery and the winter storm which refuses leave quietly are exceedingly well executed these types shorts were things which hugh harman and rudolf ising are noted for but they probably also helped lead their ultimate departure from mgm because this cartoon probably went over budget and mgm finally decided that they could control costs better the animation department were managed someone little more conscious cost than harman and ising were this truly beautiful cartoon and well worth seeing available the dvd attack the 30s characters recommended particularly you like good animation
