1 |text comment limited generally the first season 1959 this superb series was one the first televised color and was highly influential persuading americans that they had buy color television set which was about 800 1959 the equivalent more than 000 today how many would pay that much for the privilege watching show transmitted cathode ray picture tube inch screen was eleven when the series began and watched from the beginning watching now years later several things come mind first many the story lines involve the comstock lode and the heyday silver mining which dates 1859 for 1859 the weapons and clothes are for the most part not authentic the haircuts are left out the discussion that basically nitpick and would have been impossible for ben have arrived the lake tahoe area 1839 and have amassed 100 square mile ranch the next twenty years pioneers were still trying solve the sierra nevada problem late 1847 and the gold rush did not even begin until two years later indians are not played native american actors john ford was using native american actors the 1920s the bonanza producers could have easily done thirty years later that major nitpick for there are other time line problems season mark twain appears and depicted middle aged man mark twain was years old 1859 the stories also vacillate between 1859 1860 pre civil war and what was more suitable for 1880 time frame there are continuity problems over and over somewhat off putting too that there much killing the first season time the killing was reduced many the episodes take socially liberal slant which would hard believe given the time line but give the writers credit for anticipating the seismic shifts the nation attitudes beginning the 1960s having said all that the acting good and have come conclude latter years that adam character was drawn better than any other don think pernell roberts ever got the credit deserved also season reinforces the fact that dan blocker hoss was good actor many the stories trace real historical events the guest stars were interesting this was great family entertainment and the series stands very well any measure
