1 |text the secret kells astonishing first animated feature which will dazzle your eye and move your heart the shortcomings the film limited budget and sometimes limited animation are more than compensated for the visual poetry the story young brendan heroic quest become master illuminator during the dark ages historically this was the late 8th century when the centers irish learning were over run the vikings the vikings appear here brute antagonists the equivalent the north seas the plundering huns and mongols further east the film narrative which functions more parable centers around the conflict between brendan who seeks create beauty his illuminations during time encroaching darkness and his stern uncle the abbot who seeks protect the town kells and his nephew with looming wall barrier against the norsemen the abbot disregards the value brendan art his quest for security this the movie outer conflict brendan inner conflict find the hidden eye creative illumination which will allow him complete the most difficult painting the book kells this eye guarded dragon ouroboros who destroys from within those not suited this quest surely the vikings will kill from without that much the story divulge what really like about this film its creators imaginative understanding some the greatest art work survive the west from 1200 years ago the characters are stylized flat abstract shapes defined line just the original book kells particularly noteworthy monk aidan pet cat defined few lines yet purely and even magically metamorphically feline the range emotion which brendan and the other animated characters convey given their economy abstract design tribute the excellent artistry the director and his animators the decorative borders the edge the picture change complement the dramatic impact given scene and this characteristic illuminations from the dark ages brought wondrous animated life the secret kells course historical dramas usually tell more about our own times than the times which these dramas endeavor depict however introducing archetypal elements into this story the writers and director the secret kells convey numinous sense lived life from that far off time ireland which feels psychologically true however much the script might stray from pedantic historical fact the united nations band illuminators who appear rogues club artists the secret kells aren historically probable but they all well designed individuated characters who much convey the universal appeal this quintessentially irish story animation has always seemed the best vehicle better help understand the visual art different times and cultures the magnificent art direction this movie clearly derives from its historical visual source but has also been cleverly adapted the demands animated storytelling animation had existed the dark ages the secret kells what would look like finally brendan hero quest this film the artist perennial quest convey the spirit beauty life and inspiration without being preachy even particularly christian this movie affirms jesus dictum that man does not live bread alone estimation the most inspired movie about the creative process visual artists andrei tarkovsky andrei rublev film about the great russian icon painter the 15th century the secret kells expresses much the same sense mystery and exhilaration about the artist visual quest and creative process certainly not profound andrei rublev but heck its cartoon and one which will appeal young and old alike think this movie will hold well repeated viewing its own modest life affirming way this stylized secret kells classic
