nutes for those you who are interested such things noticed couple the goofs listed here the imdb page for cold blood are incorrect exaggerated such the reversed process shot the beginning the film dick and perry are driving across the bridge into kansas begin with this isn even process shot the camera actually positioned the backseat and the image you see beyond the windshield the car real large cargo truck located the left front dick pontiac creates the optical illusion that they are going backward because traveling greater rate speed but closer examination will reveal that they are indeed going forward and actual shot filmed from moving vehicle previously stated this one the ten best works 20th century cinema not recommended for the very young due some course language and implied and inferred violence actual your face gore modern film would resort but thoroughly excellent film
