1 |text always controversial movies like this have mixed reviews you either love you hate and not everyone will like this movie this shows the perspective the killers which something personally feel something important consider you may hate them you may claim understand them and feel though you can relate but regardless this movie will make you think about school shootings from different perspective the movie shot entirely using hand held camera something that think works quite well makes more realistic told completely from the killers point view from their missions family outings all leading the big day zero day which they are planning massacre their school zero day does not offer answers but merely presents glimpse the lives two troubled young boys and lets the audience decide for themselves our feelings towards the boys are something mixed between sympathy and hatred but yet are left confused why two ordinary young boys would such thing they are shown surprisingly normal typical teenage boys leading ordinary lives and didn know what they were planning wouldn expect thing they make clear throughout the whole movie that one else knows about their plan the acting extremely good considering the two actors are complete unknowns can only hope see more work from the both them the future despite how this fictionalized movie one cannot help but notice the obvious similarities columbine calvin and andre are scarily similar eric harris and dylan klebold not much looks but manner someone who has researched columbine very extensively could see the similarities and almost certainly based the actual massacre shown through surveillance cameras the school and one the most chilling things have ever seen was completely shock after seeing and its feeling that stays around for while very realistic and well done and very difficult watch all all zero day excellent movie and think everyone should least check out the past have always simply branded killers psychopaths and assumed that either they were biologically wired for disaster had media influence but zero day shows sometimes the motives are deeper than that and can never truly understand why tragedies such school shootings happen until have seen from the perspective the killers
