1 |text the first two thirds this biopic fetish model betty page are very interesting betty portrayed with enormous sincerity gretchen mol comes across pleasant girl next door type who saw nothing wrong with what she did and there certainly wasn anything wrong with director mary harron who also made shot andy warhol and american psycho recreates betty america mixing old black and white stock footage with new degraded black and white footage once betty lands florida and starts working with bunny yeager color introduced betty notoriety was mostly the result her work with paula and irving klaw lili taylor great performance and chris bauer well john willie jared harris the scenes where harron recreates betty bondage photography sessions are fascinating and adroitly executed the early purveyors fetish material are not portrayed too condescendingly and get sense that these folks were part tight community betty never had too much problem with her notoriety although get the impression that her reputation prevented her from gaining legitimacy the straight acting world because the film third act virtually non existent are left with the impression that have been watching feature length documentary betty page rather than structured drama flaws aside film well worth catching and represents yet another fine feather the cap producer christine vachon
