gh she occasionally shrill she never for second projects the coy and arch qualities that afflicted many child stars including jane powell and some the other young sopranos who followed the wake her success short like all great singing stars durbin was much more than just beautiful voice the other hand while durbin pure lyric soprano truly remarkable and glorious instrument the most remarkable thing about was the way she able project her songs without the slightest bit affectation grandnes that afflict the singing adult opera singers like lily pons grace moore and jeanette macdonald films the period the film also delightful heavily influenced screwball comedy backs durbin with creme creme first class screwball pros such charles winninger binnie barnes alice brady ray milland and mischa auer the story light and entertaining true hardly realistic but why would anyone expect you want realistic rent the grapes wrath triumph the will the other hand you looking for genuine sweet funny and entertaining family comedy with wonderfully charismatic and gifted adolescent lead and terrific supporting players this film won let you down
