ls once more and chavo locked the sharpshooter game over nice hard fought battle albeit slow times wwe cruiserweight championship gregory helms jimmy wang yang for this one fairly moderate paced match the match had some good high flying spots xc2 x96 most notably helms moves off the top rope xc2 x96 but the crowd didn seem into after witnessing the ladder match and yang needs get more airborne helms won the match after blowing yang away with facebuster the knee the undertaker kennedy last ride match after series matches between these two this time last ride match the second ever its kind and the winner has escort his opponent out the arena hearse pretty good indeed for what these two could offer kennedy manhandled good deal taker and even broke free chokeslam throw taker off the armageddon set about feet below and thank god for kennedy otherwise would been brutal kennedy almost got the win until taker got back inside the hearse liked the camera view inside the hearse taker then missed steel pipe hurl kennedy and broke the hearse window instead but then later busted kennedy open with chair and followed with consecutive chokeslam and tombstone the hearse roof kennedy was unconscious and taker drove him out the arena win actually found myself really interested into these guys willingness take give real sick shots santa comes into the ring what the hell like many the kids the crowd and then the word lingerie contest gets ear break time batista john cena finlay king booker talk about charisma technicality this match was actually quite good main event with the momentum rationally shifting from one team the other and retaining good suspense even finlay got some legitimate good shots his opponents this time kind doubted his strength against the champs and him and booker mainly didn succeed trying cheat xc2 x97 except one point where booker rammed his scepter into cena throat batista hits the bomb booker for the win didn get see the cena performed the knuckle shuffle anyhow 