1 |text all the kung films made through the and this one that has developed real cult following with the exception all the films bruce lee starred this film that has stood the test time and its due the unique story aging kung master tells his last pupil yang tieh sheng chiang about five pupils has trained the past all five wore masks and nobody has seen the face each other and they have all been trained differently their specialty kung the name they have adopted like lizard snake centipede toad and scorpion the master called them the poison clan and does not know what has happened them wants tieh find them and help the ones that are doing good stop the others that are evil old man who was once member the poison clan has map where has hidden lot money and seems target tieh does not know what they look like has mingle society and try and figure out who they are tieh has discovered that the snake hung wen tung pai wei and along with tang sen kue feng who the centipede they kill family find the map map found mystery man who turns out the scorpion but know one knows who local policeman named yung sin philip kwok investigates the murders along with his partner chow chien sun sin has friend called meng who the toad and they know each others identity the snake bribes the local officials pin the murders and while prison tortured and killed when sin finds out teams with tieh and together they combat tung and kue this film was directed cheh chang and was very special director when came these films chang was not your run the mill kung director and his films always had special quality them while most martial arts films deal with revenge chang did not use that central theme even though there some revenge going later this story this film more complex than that five men trained the same master different ways and wearing masks then they are all the same area and not knowing who the other very unique story makes this film different from all the others and most changs stories were class all themselves wouldn exactly put the same league enter the dragon because bruce lee was worldwide icon and the martial arts exhibited were more authentic looking this film still has some impossible feats like clinging sides walls and all the flipping through the air but this film isn necessarily about fight scenes its more about the intrigue the story and the characters that are involved that alone makes this different from all the other kung films very well made with unique story
