ifals the stage james king wolfgang windgassen rene kollo and today own placido domingo yvone minton sensual voiced dramatic and exciting kundry delving into her tormented state perfectly while the production certainly unorthodox and wagnerian can possibly get wagner concept was christian ceremonial pomp with grails spears castles knights and wounded kings dark sorcerer darkness turning into light etc typical wagnerian themes still enjoyable art house film
