1 |text flavia monaca muslmana aka flavia the heretic 1974 truly disturbing and uncompromising piece italian exploitation cinema that certain extent follows somewhat feminist premise though the level sleaze and brutality would probably disgust the majority feminists set mostly convent and with nun the eponymous central protagonist great performance the wonderful florinda bolkan flavia the heretic may referred nunsploitation film however this film differs quite drastically from the typical nunsploitation flicks from the time doesn much focus the nunsploitation elements such lesbianism sadistic lesbian punishments etc personally saw more similarities the hexploitation flicks the time such mark the devil even though this one doesn treat the topic witch hunts which focus the brutal execution christian fundamentalism the middle ages and early modern period italy around 1600 after witnessing her despotic father behead wounded muslim soldier young flavia forced become nun convent when her father condemns fellow nun torturous death for small misdemeanor years later falvia disgust with male violence against women turns into hatred against the despotic church and she joins band arabic scavengers one thing for sure flavia the heretic not for the faint hearted and neither for those who want happy endings director gianfranco mingozzi obviously tried make his film realistic and disturbing possible especially its nasty scenes the many torture and execution scenes are extremely disturbing with skinnings spikings and other gruesome scenes explicit detail the most shocking scene probably being the torture the young nun quite the beginning the film the violence here never superfluous however after all this gruesome methods actually were reality the time the film set the film very well made with realistic costumes fantastic settings elegant cinematography and great score nicola piovani the stunningly beautiful and great florinda bolkan has proved her talent many great italian cult productions including lucio fulci giallo masterpiece non sevizia paperino 1972 she delivers another great charismatic performance here and couldn imagine another actress fitting well the role she does the film has some minor inconsistencies why does the rigid church let bizarre cult followers into convents the first place however overall amazing how realistic this film flavia the heretic should definitely not missed fellow fans italian exploitation cinema this great exploitation flick overall though definitely deeply depressing one and therefore should watched the right mood highly recommended fans disturbing exploitation cinema
1 |text prequel the imagined battlestar galactica series from the same creative team ronald moore and david eick well new series creator remi aubuchon caprica set the twelve colonies some years prior the events battlestar galactica the new series addition its human drama also chronicles the key steps the development what would become the cylon race the pilot and the series are set follow two families the graystone which include daniel eric stoltz computer genius and corporate tycoon and his equally brilliant but rebellious daughter zoe alessandra toreson while the adama include joseph esai morales lawyer and his son william the future admiral battlestar galactica like battlestar galactica the series includes some great experienced actors eric stoltz esai morales and polly walker well some very talented relatively new actors including alessandra toreson and magda apanowicz for fans battlestar gallactica there are similarities and continuities with that series but also very different the pilot least the science fiction elements are definitely present but are smaller part this series the scenes caprica while reflecting more technologically advanced society also have retro feel this achieved through some the architecture the costumes and the way shot while the look and feel the two series have some substantial differences some the themes will seem very familiar religion again very important here while the racial theme rarely touched far more important also touch terrorism the existence soul and whether not machine can have one well issues related crime and government the pilot has been released direct dvd extended and unrated version prior airing the series set start 2010 like battlestar galactica this series filmed vancouver
