1 |text spoilers spoilers after two outings magnum force and the enforcer dirty harry seems have regained his stride sudden impact gripping thriller that wisely plays its strengths the charisma clint eastwood who also directed and story that spends just enough time exposition and reserves its energy for the big scenes for once the case takes harry outside his native san francisco where again trouble with his superiors for his shoot first ask questions later tactics the hamlet san paulo there warning potential spoiler group lowlifes being gruesomely murdered one time woman whom they gang raped years earlier and whose sister has been state catatonia ever since the attack the killer portrayed sondra locke and she makes the character jennifer spencer interesting mix compassion and cold bloodedness locke cold eyes and frosty voice when either trying comfort her hospitalized sister dispensing vengeance toward the rapists are very effective painting portrait woman wronged whose years suffering and rage are now beginning bear deadly fruit the rapists are despicable lot especially the leader who has psycho nutjob practically stamped his forehead and lesbian who seems almost one the guys despite her anatomical inability participate the flashback scenes while not graphically explicit are nightmarish enough and clearly intended make the audience cheer for jennifer she kills her assailants some will dismiss sudden impact trash mindless manipulative revenge tale certain level this true but well done trash what works the movie advantage the strength the sondra locke performance giving complex character whose wounds are more visible her paintings than her gestures speech what have here action movie with point view you can take leave the idea that some wrongs deserve punished any means necessary but the mystery behind the slayings becomes clear harry realization that wisely not spelled out with dialogue presented with choice what about killer whose motivations can sympathize with but whose conduct bound law not tolerate this makes the story more interesting than the usual dirty harry fare the movie other redeeming quality eastwood direction this after all dirty harry movie and eastwood knows the character better than anyone else the movie directed with style and wit and edited give the action scenes big payoff some the best harry moments the entire series are here including harry best known line ahead make day sudden impact movie that has the courage its convictions presenting tale about despicable crime and the brutal consequences that follow also riveting detective story well made and well told and certainly never dull those criteria succeeds tremendously
