1 |text just finished watching this movie for maybe the 7th 8th time picked one night previously viewed blockbuster and absolutely loved shown people far and they have enjoyed well avoid all the hollywood glamour special effects and stress the shock factor this independent film paul ryan hits the nail the head dealing with the after affects traumatic situations taking place after high school shooting two characters alicia busy philipps and deanna erika christensen form unlikely bond alicia the girl with the stone heart the goth who has pessimistic attitude life assists deanna overcome the issues life and death and living the aftermath meanwhile deanna attempts help alicia see some the softness and light the world again not stressing the shocking event the shooting but the interpersonal relationships amongst those who survived sets this movie apart despite its low budget and short filming time this movie far from cheesy ryan pays respect situation has never endured and attempts delve into the human psyche with amazing and coming actress philipps adds the necessary dramatics the dialogue and overall feel for the film and christensen helps balance out the doom and gloom feeling this movie may have overall recommend this movie and you enjoy the topic school aggression and violence and learning more about also suggest the documentary girls world put out cbc 2004 which deals with the topic social bullying comparing and contrasting two groups girls one montreal quebec and the other victoria british columbia the group friends and acquaintances dawn marie wellesley year old girl who killed herself after being brutally bullied
