-1 |text gwoemul the host due pollution the han river mutated beast goes the rampage the youngest member the park family snatched the beast and the rest her family find her before she becomes the beast latest meal firstly love monster movies mutated bears over sized alligators packs ravening komodo dragons the whole lot creature features are favourite kind horror film really wanted like the host but wasn there were three major problems with the first can seen with quick look imdb page genre action comedy drama fantasy horror sci thriller too many damned genres took itself too seriously comedy and yet was too light hearted have any real message though did seem trying make some kind statement anti pollution anti american anti government the drama was misplaced and mixed confusing mish mash with all the other styles secondly after the initial monster attack nothing happens for almost the entire film the central family wander about looking for one their own while the governments korea and america apparently nothing and that they just wander about occasionally hitting one another presumably for bit comedy relief this lack action made attention wander and apparently did the same for the director whole plot threads unresolved mystery plague invented the evil americans completely forgotten about and never resolved and lastly the film clumsily political paints the americans being stupid and evil but gives american characters with any more depth than cartoon villain the opening scene has the most obvious stupid american wise korean moment with korean morgue assistant asking his boss the coroner not pour chemicals into the han river the american coroner all but cackles maniacally orders the assistant carry well being racist lazy film making and there excuse for that the plus side the monster good kind mix the relic and deep rising some the movement effects are quite cool and the initial monster chase through the park lot fun there are also some nice shots the film some which remind strangely the way firefly was filmed shuddering cameras out focus shots etc there also nice scene the end where the hero and little boy has saved are sitting the family mobile food stall night time and snow falling the street lamp giving out cold light but the food stall has warm glow coming from overall was really disappointed this film been looking forward decent creature flick and instead get some pseudo political horror comedy lite looking the comments imdb can help but think that this had been production would have been slated just cause foreign flick doesn mean any good there have been some great movies out korea recent years the vengeance trilogy and brotherhood for example but this certainly isn one them for once favour remake tighten the directing improve the scripting and this could have been nice film not worth couple hours anyone time
