-1 |text not usually given hyperbole but after seeing over two decades worth academy awards can honestly say that this year awards show was the most disgraceful example poor direction total cruelty and sheer stupidity that ever had the misfortune witness not talking about the awards themselves usual there plenty argue about when you tally who won who lost and who never even got nominated but the process always been and fair liable what terribly unfair the treatment both the stars and non stars received the hands cates and horvitz the name reducing boredom bad enough that for the last several years anyone who isn pacino has been played off seconds without any regard for what was saying how was saying and what the emotion was behind the statement demonstrates nothing more than total lack respect however herd nominees the stage like cattle without paying them the honor showing their faces while their names are read make them slink away quietly when they lose deny them the thrill walk the podium and force them read their statements with their backs the audience all those things were done the non stars never mind that the movies wouldn exist all without those artists and that most them only ever get one chance face their peers and their audience the stars didn fare much better becoming more sad than funny when winners the caliber hilary swank and clint eastwood have beg for few extra seconds for their speeches chris rock host was neither inflammatory and controversial the academy had hoped nor nearly funny could his opening remarks were almost but not quite offensive sean penn made them out and his comments during the show were more innocuous than interesting course could hardly blamed when was clear that was being kept short leash any host has the end chris rock was something almost never been before non entity even the musical numbers were handled poorly beyonce sang well but there was simply reason why she should have been featured three out the five songs another example utter disrespect for artist was giving jorge drexler nominated song antonio banderas even though drexler was present and clearly wouldn have minded singing his own song based his winning speech the efforts cates and horvitz make the show shorter and faster may have worked degree but what resulted was show devoid life all whined about the overlong speeches given people don know about the overblown production about the self congratulatory quality but this their night not ours what meant celebration has become insult the people being celebrated cates and horvitz should frankly ashamed
