1 |text first all the release date 2009 not 2007 for this feature length nature documentary film should more properly referred earth 2009 secondly allow address the complaints some reviewers who have seen the planet earth series 2006 have not seen this series but learned here that this film the full length version this 2006 series judge any film own merits not source judge the results their own and the results earth 2009 are indeed excellent dismiss this trivial complaint some reviewers that simply expanded version the 2006 series planet earth what doesn really matter film buff and one who has viewed dozens nature documentaries lifetime was astonished and highly impressed earth 2009 this the debut film from the new disneynature division disney and follows the footsteps walt disney pioneering and academy award winning nature documentary films the 1950 and 1960 cinematography film editing music score sound and narration are all excellent there have been few other nature documentaries that also excelled these categories what really sets earth 2009 apart its scope literally covers the entire planet covering all seven continents after first viewing was obvious this documentary film required massive effort and amount time and talent create three production companies were required make this amazing documentary film earth 2009 convincingly tells the stories four species their great migrations spans one year through the seasons beginning january and ending december from the north pole the south pole two special new high tech cameras were used for this film one camera has 360 degree computer controlled motorized rotating lens and the other camera set amazing 000 frames per second this filming technique really added drama and beauty some the scenes earth 2009 especially the cheetah chase and great white sharks leaping out the water catch sea lions and aerial view going over the edge the world highest waterfall there are many stunningly beautiful shots this documentary via cinematography music score and narration there drama sadness humor and great beauty this documentary with great music score performed the world renowned berliner philharmoniker excellent creative and technical cinematography and james earl jones narration consider earth 2009 the greatest nature feature length documentary film ever made five years hard work patience talent and dedication really paid off very well here this film should required viewing all schools throughout the world predict academy award for best documentary feature among other awards truly amazing astonishing exhilarating and magnificent documentary film very highly recommended
