g didn enjoy was how one dimensional some the characters were understand that most were the supporting cast but some the cast was underused and could given the film some more spice how lose friends alienate people will never anyone top films ever even top comedies ever but has very high entertainment level and some scenes may even charm you well how lose friends alienate people definitely one the better romantic comedies the year
