acter actor hill the handsome but limited italian heart throb from numerous low budget spaghetti westerns one expects hackman act his counterpart off the screen yet bizarrely hackman who gives the weak and uninvolving performance while hill raises his game surprisingly high levels the film attractively shot desert locations but the pacing awfully slow and few the characters are worth caring for maurice jarre music uncommonly flat too xc2 x96 very disappointing from the guy who gave the lawrence arabia score remarkable that anyone had the nerve try old fashioned adventure this type the 70s was genre that peaked the 30s and had been all but forgotten during the intervening decades sadly the gamble doesn really pay off xc2 x96 this homage the legionnaire flicks old becomes more plod than march
