1 |text was not expecting much from this movie but was very pleasantly surprised light and funny and very well observed the central trio deadbeat bikers were surprisingly likable they staggered and clowned their way through their drug centred trip wales the humour was gentle and subtle indeed were the three characters witness their sympathetic treatment the little old lady shopkeeper the atmospherics rural wales were captured perfectly and the soundtrack was very well chosen cleverly and carefully scripted with great attention detail have never seen such realistic portrayal alternative culture felt was there with them very light touch and full fun not what you might expect from movie about bikers and drugs delight all fronts and difficult criticise though thought the last two scenes were bit lame the film should have ended when they left wales but overall unexpected treasure film
