ch every aspect the production whereas with some other films you left rather expecting there more and such extremely pleasant track that complements the main feature very nicely indeed the featurette rated horror film worthwhile effort with peter duffell again center stage but this time backed with valid all too brief contributions from producer max rosenberg and stars chloe franks ingrid pitt and geoffrey bayldon also get film notes reviews bios and poster stills gallery which again are wonderfully assembled with the contemporary reviews being something novelty and welcome one that
