1 |text some unsuspecting films carry message that resonates the hours and days after viewing such the case for carol journey viaje carol beautifully crafted 2002 film from spain based the novel boca noche xc3 x81ngel garc xc3 xada rold xc3 xa1n who also adapted the book screenplay war and its consequences are not new subject matter for films but when that war theme plays the background subtle driving force develop characters especially children who must face adult life influenced the games adults the result different and more tender examination the coming age film genre carol clara lago year old spanish american youngster from new york who with her critically ill mother aurora mar xc3 xada barranco returns her aurora home 1938 the height the spanish civil war home that has been left deserted her father don amalio xc3 x81lvaro luna since his wife death carol father robert ben temple fighter pilot who has sided with the republicans against franco and rarely with his family aurora has past she left her lover alfonso alberto jim xc3 xa9nez marry robert and alfonso turn married aurora cold sister dolores lucina gil carol independent girl who remains aloof all but her grandfather don amalio until she meets others her age but not her class tomiche juan jos xc3 xa9 ballesta and his two friends first resent carol but events develop carol and tomiche are bonded what feels like the first awakenings love when aurora dies her illness carol must live with alfonso and dolores and their daughter blanca luna mcgill yet turns her grandfather for support and her mother best friend and teacher maruja the always radiant rosa maria sard xc3 xa0 understand the disparity between classes and the senseless war that keeps her beloved father from her side through series incidents carol and tomiche learn the rigors becoming adults facing more traumas brief period the war than most experience lifetime the ending though sad uplifting carol journey maturity complete the film shot galicia and portugal and contains some extraordinarily beautiful settings captured with gentle sensitive lighting cinematographer gonzalo berridi and enhanced the musical score bingen mendiz xc3 xa1bal director imanol uribe understands the fine line separating pathos from bathos and electing concentrate the story the children involved makes even stronger statement about the futility and cruelty war the cast exceptional the stars clearly are young clara lago and juan jos xc3 xa9 ballesta but they are supported the fine veteran actors the adult roles this visually stunning work with lasting message and should find much larger audience than has this date grady harp
