1 |text time for hit waqt dir vipul amrutlal shah cast amitabh bachchan akshay kumar priyanka chopra shefali shah rajpal yadav and boman irani written aatish kapadia rating eureka got yes ladies and gentlemen xc2 x85in vipul shah waqt have probably found this year first bona fide hit replete with all the necessary ingredients commercial bollywood fare waqt has all that takes for movie click with the indian audiences the kinda film that makes distributor feel happy and contemplate his next phoren visit this saga indian emotions then have happy family isn always three ishwar amitabh bachchan the postman turned millionaire don ask how there something about selling toys while delivering letters and all that xc2 x85seriously who gives damn married sumi shefali shah doting father aditya akshay kumar ishwar has make serious decision about his son careless attitude towards the responsibilities life his love for aditya though results his procrastination the grave issue however when faced with situation that will test his race against time ishwar has alternative but throw aditya out the house hoping that the new predicament might make him more conscientious his own life but this presumed solution becomes problem itself the rift between the loving father son increases and the fences continue grow you don have rocket scientist realize that such story provides ample opportunities infuse comedy and drama alike pre interval you have the initially funny later annoying comedy track boman irani and rajpal yadav and post interval there are the for your kerchief moments between aby and akki writer aatish kapadia also penned the original gujarati play aavjo vhala fari malishu which the film based does good job keeping the narrative fluid the dialogues tend get inconsistent times doesn help that songs appear like acne teenage face and mar the proceedings clearly couple numbers could been done away with the directing front vipul shows that possesses natural flair for story telling waqt well his earlier debut effort aankhen manage keep you interested till the last reel personal note the seesaw emotions was tad jerky for but gauging from the audience reactions was working the hilt finally waqt all about its performances which amount one whole point the overall rating amitabh bachchan dependable always his energy visible and his age shefali pitches finely nuanced performance and matches the superstar every step boman and rajpal bring the house down with their histrionics priyanka has little than fulfill the perfunctory role heroine when all boils down though waqt akshay vehicle have always maintained that akki good the role suits him put him mujhse shaadi karogi and fantastic but bewafaa woefully bad here akki probably his best whether his comic timing his emotional renderings near perfect there also action scene for his fans ironically his previous best endeavour was aankhen with the same director and big his side waqt means memorable movie not one that will feature the better films our industry but one for the masses and time when the industry waiting desperately for universal hit waqt might just the trick abhishek bandekar trivia this akshay kumar second consecutive film after bewafaa which performs stage during the climax rating poor average good very good excellent 22nd april 2005
