1 |text september 2003 year old jonny kennedy died had terrible genetic condition called dystrophic epidermolysis bullosa which meant that his skin literally fell off the slightest touch leaving his body covered agonising sores and leading final fight against skin cancer his last months jonny decided work with filmmaker patrick collerton document his life and death and the result was film first broadcast march that was uplifting confounding and provocatively humorous story singular man not shying away from the grim reality the film was also celebration life lived the full produced and directed patrick collerton and first shown march 2004 the boy whose skin fell off has become the most talked about documentary that year attracted nearly five million viewers and after the screening the public donated over half million pounds jonny charity debra jonny kennedy memorial fund has been set raise another half million with the aim ensuring that jonny kennedy left one million pound legacy
