1 |text pet sematary succeeds two major situations first scary horror movie those that just aren produced these days second emotional clever movie overall you are looking for chills scares creepiness and visually stunning settings great acting dialongs and gruesome effects this the movie you are looking for classic now and truly must see for any horror fan probably the best adaptation any king novels the events feel little rushed compared with the novel but that doesn means that this underrated movie isn complete horror drama accomplishment stephen king novel widely known for being very emotional and gruesome the same time the movie captures the same feeling mainly because there great character development and you can feel the loving relationship between members then when everything seems happiness technically happy because the title pet sematary does not offers appiness tragic event changes the movie atmosphere now turns very dark the movie has sinister feeling since the opening credits but after gage killed the movie becomes sad gray creepy dealing with the loss baby son something that can ruin family entire life and pet sematary proves dramatically the legend behind the pet sematary more than myth that one wants experience but sadness and desperation lead emotionally destroyed father give shot sadly enough the legend comes true and baby gage returns from the dead the previous encounter with the pet sematary legend turned out tragedy but this time something much much worse what will happened with the lives our all american family could pascow prevent this tragedy what with the surreal nightmares watch pet sematary witness one the most touching emotional horror movies recent times you won regret the acting very good although didn dig the actor who portrayed the father didn seem disturbed enough when the situations asked for his desperation but that just opinion denise crosby truly delivered great performance and worked perfect the noble tender mother baby gage was amazing even his creepy parts shivers overall this great classic all time and disturbing movie that touches people deepest fears the loss someone you love the dead returning life and feeling desperation something for sure don wanna buried pet sematary
