1 |text this beautiful rich and very well executed film with rich and meaningful story basically tells how old master story teller needs find male heir carry his craft but ends not getting what expected his very male dominated world the characters must then deal with their situation and the old master must grapple with the conflict between his desire for companion and heir and his and society traditional notions the story fun emotional and complex the exploration the characters their lives and emotions rich and compelling the character development strong while the characters are complex and not one dimensional all the film expertly conveys the old man emotions and his desire find heir and compellingly shows how and the kid handle the situation there also humour sometimes quite subtle appropriate points the film also examines the good and bad traditional chinese culture creating further interest and depth the film the directing acting and scenery are all outstanding added the other strengths this creates rich and convincing visual images and compelling real characters result the film evokes strong empathy for and feelings about the characters some have claimed that the ending weakens the film but not necessarily agree perhaps could have been stronger with different ending but any improvement the overall film would have been rather small
