1 |text the man from snowy river doesn reinvent the wheel but crowd pleasing beautiful film that hits some great notes for those fans wanting the elements that made the original man from snowy river film hit breathtaking scenery sweeping score sweet romanticism and cracking action this film really delivers this story picks few years from the end the first jim tom burlinson has been away gathering his fortune brood stock horses returns pick where left off with his pluckish well bred sweetheart jessica played aussie divine lady sigrid thornton who still attempting break out her corseted upbringing her feather cattle station harrison now played american brian dennehy the foil jim and character that shakes the plot the well upper class snob alistair patton nicholas eadie who has his sights jessica add the mix some social tension surrounding landholdings and the stallion with bad attitude from the first film and that the plot the best thing about this film the acting tom burlinson fits snugly into jim wide brim hat and laconic humour sigrid thornton lovely heroine and the two manage some real chemistry screen filling the solid shoes kirk douglas was never going easy and brian dennehy stomps and shouts but never feels very authentic this part the music sweeping and lush and the cinematography could roll from victoria tourism reel there are moment however that feel very self indulgent like the director wants just one more helicopter shot the riders show how gorgeous the landscape without some personal human drama little more grit would have sufficed here are aussie can take there are some very jawsish moments with the stallion that defy belief however the funny thing about this film that amongst some glaring clich xc3 xa9s there are some really inventive and touching scenes jim putting the saddle the stallion very horse whisperish before its time jim and jessica setting home the fabulous scene where jim shows alistair riding with his trusty whip can see why this character such icon altogether very pleasing sequel here hoping everyone involved wants make another the man from snowy river iii the craigs sure all love see how jim and jessica are doing their farm the aussie dvd has couple extra scenes worthwhile you are already fan
