1 |text here one more beauty the string beautiful films directed eytan fox the movie presents the story star crossed lovers one israeli one palestinian modern tel aviv the film effectiveness comes not only from its depiction cross ethnic conflict but conflicts personal and political within ethnic groups well for example there telling moment when one the secondary characters openly gay visited the hospital his boyfriend who brings him flowers and tries kiss him front his visiting family and suddenly see wave awkward discomfort wash through the room clearly the young man not open seems and the family not accepting might want them while the boyfriend confused and rejected good deal complexity packed into fleeting moment know from yossi jagger fox master efficiently packing emotional and psychological complexity into brief sequences the film also effective for the even handed way presents the mutual brutalities that israelies and palestinians inflict each other you not heartless you cry through the last third the movie though the plot melodramatic intelligently written and acted that reminds how satisfying good melodrama can
