oards pilgrims from all around the world and the sensation trip significance overwhelming reda the manner which the story comes close touching and rich with meaning has taken religious pilgrimage restore the gap between youth and old age between son and father and between defiance and acceptance religious values the visual impact this film extraordinary all the more because feels though the camera just happens catch the beauty the many stopping points along the way without the need enhance them with special effects nicolas cazal xc3 xa9 superb actor sure see his most recent and currently showing film the grocer son and his carefully nuanced role that brings the magic this film another fine film from the film movement this tender story brilliantly told highly recommended grady harp
