1 |text cypher cleverly conceived story about industrial espionage set america the not too distant future while thematically not complex this film does offer many different perspectives about personal loyalty ruthlessness and corporate conspiracy certain extent this film also attempts represent modern corporate groups and companies being indifferent the risks their contract employees take their behalf the film starts off with somewhat mediocre salary man morgan sullivan jeremy northam who applies the digicorp group work undercover operative after initial briefing with digicorp security chief sullivan then given new identity jack thursby and sent business conference with the task recording the speeches given various spokesmen concerning the marketing strategies each their respective companies upon successfully completing his first assignment sullivan thursby sent further missions obtain the same type information previously gathered however one his business trips inadvertently runs into woman named rita foster liu whom had met his previous assignment and from there things extremely topsy turvy the implications diabolical conspiracy involving digicorp espionage program begin emerge and sullivan forced deep cover one digicorp main competitors thus becoming double agent involved intense rivalry between the two companies spoilers end here what liked most about this film was the efficient use lighting and shadows lot the scenes vivid lighting was used mainly domestic household settings while lot shadows and dark coloring were used for settings involving deception and cover was also very impressed with jeremy northam not too often have seen him the lead role and the fact that plays disenchanted married man straight out wisconsin was brilliant personally think one the many under used actors the industry who hasn been given more challenging roles lucy liu was also incredible her part and gave the movie its real cloak and dagger tone additionally the rest the supporting cast did superb job however only complaint was that some characters could have been explored more make the plot and closure little more complicated for example would have loved see what would have happened jack thursby had developed more intimate relationship with his second wife overall this cleverly developed cloak and dagger story that keeps you guessing the very end about personal and professional loyalties and whether anyone the entire film can trusted with smart and stylish soundtrack and great camera work this film provides scary look how corporations might operate the near future surprised that had never watched this hidden gem before this brilliant not too overly complicated spy thriller and therefore giving out
