1 |text what happens when the average joe finds out has supernatural powers the premise may sound familiar the watchmen unbreakable however the russian sci action flick the sword bearer far from the standard stock the story revolves around man named sasha who boy was shunned from society his peers and family due supernatural power that possess when wishes his anger allows sword extends from his arm piercing his own skin very wolverinish maybe but that not the interesting part this film shunned all his life and driven anger and temper does have our hero returns his home town turn his life around find reason the only thing encounters here trouble when encounter with old flame new boyfriend leaves him bloodied the ground this where the vengeance and anger comes into play this man you not want cross and from this point the mafia and the police are his tail meets girl and falls love instantly does she and this really what the movie about the film highly impressionistic with bold colors and noir overtones spliced with short yet extreme action sequences this art house core beautifully filmed with such attention details every scene over gruesome sci action this odd mash that interests much this film the directors approach for this genre refreshing focusing the emotional journey sasha and not straight action film don worry though the action there and plenty however much these sequences show only implied violence with pictures the horrific aftermath this not say that action not shown these scenes are here and are fantastic especially the ending where see sasha full powers unleashed desperation the director chooses imply the violence many scenes keep the focus the character emotional struggle hand this tragic love story and refreshing entry into the genre
