1 |text page most definitely very enthralling and captivating eye opener that very cleverly exposes the hypocrite lifestyles mumbai elite from the fake kisses the plastered smiles page leaves stone unturned revealing the shocking lives the rich and the famous backstabbing gossip corruption and scandal lurk every dark corner the world glitz and glam humanity and generosity are analogous oasis the desert this world where social darwinism the prevailing mentality everyone constantly craving for more money more fame and higher reputation driving them the most shameful things imaginable ranging from signing film contracts funeral child molestation anything possible this metropolis where there such wide gap between the social classes the audience sees the ugliness both these classes through the eyes the protagonist she observes the suffocating atmosphere and the mind boggling frenzy that the socialites live bollywood business tycoons politicians and the underworld are all intertwined completely convoluted mess kitne ajeeb hai nice track the peppy kuan main doob jaongi terrific film with excellent character development
