g from garbo the special effects here primitive though they seem now are quite remarkable for their time they look very similar the shots used 20th century fox the rains came that came out 1939 and that won oscar for special effects unfortunately for torrent came out one year before oscar made his debut not going give any endings away you have see the film find out cortez and garbo get together the end garbo rightly won rave reviews for her performance and age when exaggerated gestures was the norm silent screen acting she was remarkably subtle her role she would the rest her career she had remarkable face for closeups although greta garbo would far better work than torrent this film still fitting debut for her the american big screen and holds very well for today audience
