1 |text shame this movie hard get your hands the found through rare video dealer and was certainly worth this without doubt the best film made during the pre code era and the finest film the 1930s masterful director frank borzage made wonderful films about the depression and with man castle created fairy tale amidst the hardships the era loretta young and spencer tracy have wonderful chemistry between them and they help make this movie wonderful romance young trina sweet and hopeful while tracy bill gruff and closed off the dynamic between the character creates one the most difficult but the end rewarding relationships film man castle the most soft focus pre code film seen borzage uses the hazy and dreamy technique turn the squatter village where bill and trina live into palace the hardships the depression are never ignored fact they integral the film but borzage crafts the film soft focus fairy tale the love between the characters makes the situation seem less harsh makes the film warm and affectionate man castle the crowning achievement the pre code era only more people could see
