ack glad that the show was never revived though without oakland would not have been the same have the rice books now and have read them several times was very surprised when stephen king slated the first his book danse macabre good anything has written alright some the monsters were hardly state the art but what the new kolchak totally missed the point the original what you don see sometimes more frightening than what you best episode horror the heights worst episode the sentry
