1 |text there has been political documentary recent vintage called why fight which tries examine the infamous military industrial complex and its grip this nation considered both polemical and incisive making its case against both that complex and the war fiasco are currently involved iraq yet far more famous series films with the same name was made during world war two hollywood director frank capra although considered documentaries and having won oscars that category this series seven films really and truly mere agitprop more the vein leni reifenstal triumph the will scenes which capra recycles for his own purposes that said that fact does not mean does not have vital information that subsequent generations world war two documentaries such the bbc lauded the world war lacked nor does that mean that its value primary source any the less valuable they are skillfully made and after recently purchasing some used dvds discount store found myself with the opportunity select free dvd with purchase chose goodtimes dvd four dvd collection the series rarely has something free been worth invaluable while there are extras the dvds and the sound quality the prints varies these films provide insight into the minds americans two thirds century ago when racism was overt many the classic warner brothers pro war cartoons the era and there was nothing wrong with blatant distortion facts the seven films produced between 1942 and 1945 are prelude war the nazis strike divide and conquer the battle britain the battle russia the battle china and war comes america overall the film series well worth watching not only for the obvious reasons but for the subtle things reveals such the use the plural for terms like millions when referring dollars rather than the modern singular the most overused graphic the whole series japanese sword piercing the center manchuria yet also shows the complexities trying apply past standards current wars the lesson world war one avoid foreign entanglements was not applicable world war two whose own lesson act early against dictatorships has not been applicable the three major wars america has fought since korea vietnam nor iraq the fact that much this series teeters the uncertainties the times was made only underscores its historic value today information clogged times may not help you sort out the truth from the lies and propaganda today but least you realize you are not the first such tenuous position nor will you the last
