y are the right track find suleiman one the most heart rending scenes they kill party slave traders only find that was not suleiman group and have choice but send their captives the tuaregs they met earlier later discover that the young boy who had been raped witch doctor and excellent scene with supernatural overtones uses his knowledge kill one suleiman henchmen anansa her part and despite the scepticism the boy manages engineer the demise suleiman two other employees this time suleiman and his slaves are within days reaching the slave market suleiman now doubt that anansa trouble attempts sell her obscenely wealthy arab prince omar sharif who corrupt but intelligent discovering that anansa american working for the the prince rather unwisely decides carry with the bargaining without considering the consequences the scene where the two men haggle one the best the film the slave market the young boy sold middle aged german paedophile and are left guess whether the boy will still considered wunderbar when his owner the receiving end his witch doctoring skills david and malik finally confront suleiman and there bitter sweet ending from malik point view ultimately david and anansa are united and malik whose life ruins can console himself with having seen the task set himself completed the overall plot the film excellent but loses marks for its stereotypical portrayal nearly all the leading characters credit must all the leading actors for addressing many the shortcomings the scripting
