1 |text the goal any james bond game make the player feel like fulfilling ultimate fantasy step into the shoes agent 007 frwl comes closer this goal than any other game because this time you control the real james bond offense pierce brosnan who made fantastic bond and loaned his voice and likeness eon but sean connery was the original james bond and there will never anyone who comes close his level cool must say this point like many others who have reviewed this game that sean year old voice doesn fit his year old image screen and this takes some getting used but certainly worth makes lines like bond xc2 x85 james bond and shaken not stirred into big deal again but controlling sir sean takes the evil organization known octopus bond said octopussy only the tip the tentacle the awesomeness the game begins with the opening gun barrel the original gun barrel from the movies then you take first mission rescuing the prime minister hottie blonde daughter from terrorists parliament and everything from the cars the clothes perfectly retro the world the game truly the world the original james bond right down the classic rock roll rendition the james bond theme that finally plays during key moment late the game bond infiltrates secret factory after the game opening the plot faithfully follows the plot the movie frwl james bond sent turkey retrieve lektor device from russian cipher clerk who claims she has crush him turkey bond teams with lovable sidekick kerim bey bond must retrieve the device protect the damsel distress and get both safely back london bond screenwriter bruce feirstein worked the script and done good job making the game the same but different the movie the characters from the movie are all recreated well but some are better than others the impersonators voicing villains rosa klebb and red grant are uncanny and there moment early the game where you interact with miss moneypenny and who all look and behave they did the original sean connery 007 movies what puts this game miles ahead the other bond games besides sir sean voice and likeness two notable features the game play one bond focus while you can dispatch villains simply locking onto them with one button and killing them with the other additional button push will allow you zoom closer target and choose between spots bond would shoot such grenade attached belt that will dispatch enemy and few his friend rappel cord that will cause suspended enemy plunge his death the other notable feature the stealth and xc3 xaal xc3 xa9e kills when you close enough range just hit button beat down enemy with the raw brutality that only sean connery james bond displayed sean connery bond relied mostly his raw wit and talent you only have few gadgets but they good ones the copter remote control helicopter that can self destruct and explore areas bond can reach like the spider eon only better the classic laser watch useful not just for getting into sealed rooms but dispatching enemies when you have other weapon available sonic cuff links and serum gun are the most fun play around with but you must experience them for yourself besides the gadgets you can dress bond number retro costumes found during the game including the gray suit from the movie the standard black tuxedo retro stealth suit and that classic white tuxedo all which look exactly like they did when sir sean wore them the movies when you drive the game you drive the aston martin db5 straight out goldfinger can turn invisible but has gadget for popping tires like the movie and when you not flying down the streets istanbul the goldinger car you can fly through the air the thunderball jet pack then there the multi player course has compared the standard the goldeneye game and fails also you can only play bond villains rather than bond himself the other heroes the game but the multi player amusing and decent bonus since the awesomeness the single player campaign alone makes the game worth playing the basic game does have other flaws some the movie most exciting moments particularly the gypsy camp shootout bond brawl with red grant the orient express and confrontation between bond and rosa klebb bladed shoe aren done justice game form and the game fast play even the hardest difficulty but overall this game the best james bond experience far
