1 |text margaritas and cock this tremendously entertaining film grabs you from the opening scene and never stops delivering laughs surprises and unexpectedly touching moments had more fun watching the matador than almost any other film from 2005 wacky film with unforgettable character played perfection pierce brosnan julian noble brosnan facilitator hit man who specializes high end corporate gigs assassinating rich dudes also experiencing something akin mid life crisis after coming realization that has real friends permanent home and planned future stumbles into mexican hotel bar one night and runs into danny wright kinnear danny down his luck family man who the verge losing the big business deal that just might turn things around for him loves his wife dearly especially since they lost their young son few years earlier the two men are chalk and cheese hardly any common ground other than that they are the same desolate bar one night and somehow conversation struck that sets motion chain events that will change their lives forever the friendship they form reminded lot laurel and hardy one the straight man and the other the persistent fool who gets them into trouble the interplay superbly timed and finely tuned due small part the wonderful performances from brosnan and kinnear but make mistake this brosnan film imprints one the most memorable and despicably likable characters the decade could shoot your mother and apologize immediately thereafter and you probably forgive him brosnan may cinema ultimate charmer but this his most endearing and complete performance date wouldn averse seeing oscar nod for this role consider one scene where overtly ogles high school girl with the impurest thoughts and utters the line all blushy blushy sucky fucky does with the familiar bond smirk and manages get away with manages tell young boy tell your mother lose 30lbs and years then get back without coming across unlikable fact makes like him even more and yet the film manages surprise with some truly touching scenes most which come toward the end when the film takes some unpredictable turns however when julian thumbs through his little black book find someone call his birthday when danny and his wife davis console each other their bedroom one night the film reaches unexpected depth emotion the matador stylish and energetic constantly entertaining and contains career defining role for brosnan the lonely hit man looking for normalcy friendship and means least one good thing his life this overlooked gem 2005 and you should make effort see this film soon possible candler independentcritics com
