rtain point reality and dreams intersect love things like that only complaint that feels like could have ended many times but didn satisfied with the ending had some you sensitive types might want have kleenex handy though really could have variety conclusions anyway doesn exactly feel drawn out once actually over but while you watching and keeps fading back little nerve wracking still paperhouse really good film well done and acting especially charlotte burke anna top notch burke who has never before since appeared film real gem don know why she never went onto anything else but either way she really convincing and enjoyable watch paperhouse isn exactly horror movie sort fantasy suspense something else type movie with some definite horroresque moments but you can still watch with your family and not worried that your little brother grandmother will get grossed out blood splashing something give chance you won regret and maybe you should read the book too
