1 |text saw this film the chicago reeling film festival pick the previous reviewer remarks the claustrophobic feel and off colors the film sense quite intentional and conveys the sense limited space drab architecture overall drabness that constitutes the urban environment most people eastern and central europe bit shabby housing project style how describe and this how many people live the outskirts larger cities can say that familiar with bucharest romania where the action unfolded but have visited and lived eastern europe for six months when visited russia student for semester entire group had drag their luggage seven stories the staircase shabby student dorm building just the heroine does when moving with woman because the elevators weren working but concur with the reviewer that the claustrophobia and muted colors overdone for there are sure beautiful historic buildings parks squares you can find bucharest any historic city center eastern europe and bucharest didn get much any footage this film for watching this film conveys well the claustrophobia that would feel during half year stay there feeling trapped and limited makes you see why someone would want immigrate and find better life just people hope escape from united states urban ghetto also given the climate homophobia say circa the 1980s the two young women who fall love with one another are forced keep their love very private matter hence the focus their interaction the apartment remarkable and commendable view that this queer themed film was even made romania and find the complaint the previous reviewer about the poor film quality quite uninformed and patronizing unlikely that the director and producer drummed much government support and funding for their film and they did the best they could with their likely limited resources the actors were fairly good and believable the dialog was overall well done and could identity with these women the film offers added twist that forbidden love between two young women kiki energetic fun loving free spirit with dark troubling secret her admiration and love for abusive incestuous brother sandu falls love with alexandra bright bookish idealistic young woman who moves bucharest begin her college studies opposites attract and their personalities seem complement one another though there some tension between the ambitious studious intellectual alexandra and kiki who seems attending college please her parents keeping their love hidden from their parents seems manageable though don get any sense the tension requires nor ever see meet any other students hard believe and the tension keeping their love secret would have entailed the chief threat their love kiki brother and her difficulty trying severe her relation him but kiki love for alexandra seems give her the strength she needs finally severe this bond does that what the suspense the film focuses the narrative develops and won say how concludes ironically kiki love sickness isn love for another woman but her illicit incestuous love for her brother thus loving woman offers the potential cure the sickness loving sibling though this feel this film stifling and claustrophobic overly confined interactions between kiki and alexandra was still engaging and moving watch give
