l palestinians participating and that the police might come and spoil all the fun for them again the closest they come actual confrontation when they get into scuffle with some not palestinian friendly locals who try prevent them from handing out the leaflets other words predictable products the xc2 x84bubble the opening scenes the film take checkpoint road nablus where also find noam doing his reserve duty group palestinians being thoroughly checked before entering israel among them pregnant woman who suddenly goes into labour and gives birth stillborn child despite the best efforts from noam and the doctor who eventually arrives ambulance the woman comforted young man who later turns noam doorstep tel aviv with his which the latter obviously dropped during the ordeal the border his name ashraf palestinian and gay and hasn just come hand back the has come see noam without permit live israel and despite the initial hesitation from noam flatmates stays soon gets jewish name and job yelli cafe having grown jerusalem with hebrew doesn have arabic accent which makes possible for him and his newly found friends conceal his identity the sky light blue and the air sweet but cannot last for has become part equation which was never meant one point noam and ashraf watch play called bent about two prisoners nazi concentration camp who have love relationship which can never become physical visible the surrounding guards they find way being together another level metaphysical one level where one else has access this also where our couple arrives the end and couldn have been much different for them not today israel xc2 x84the bubble political statement about the bubble that bursts when confronted with the political realities today israel set against the background beautiful and awkward love story involving israeli and palestinian the impossible love story divided world where such things compromise other colours than black and white exist xc2 x84the bubble also beautiful film abou