1 |text cinderella one the most beloved all disney classics and really deserves its status based the classic fairy tale told charles perrault the film follows the trials and tribulations cinderella good girl who mistreated her evil stepmother and equally unlikable stepsisters when royal ball held and all eligible young women are invited read the king wants get the prince marry cinderella left home whilst her stepmother takes her awful daughters with her but there fairy godmother hand the story cinderella its own wouldn able pad out feature whilst generally staying true the story otherwise the fairly incidental characters the animals whom the fairy godmother uses help get the title character the ball become cinderella true sidekicks the mice jaq and gus are the main sidekicks and their own nemesis being the stepmother cat lucifer their antics intertwine generally with the main fairy tale plot and are for the most part wonderful admittedly the film does slow down bit between the main introduction the characters and shortly before the stepsisters depart for the ball but after this slowdown the film really gets going again and surprisingly since cinderella the most worn down story all time probably ends one the most involving disney stories the animation and art direction lovely all the legendary nine old men animated this picture and mary blair colour styling and concept art she also did concept art and colour styling for alice wonderland peter pan the three caballeros and many many others manage wiggle their way screen the colours and designs are lovely especially the fairy godmother and ball scenes well those pretty little moments here and there overall cinderella ranks one the best disney fairy tales and comes recommended young and all that embodies the disney philosophy that dreams really can come true
