-1 |text summer season here when the choices the cinemas are limited what the hottest movie the week given the screens dedicated screening may exaggerate the percentage but you get drift besides stuff from hollywood bollywood too have their own share highly anticipated blockbusters and from some the trailers shown hyped watch them too tashan was billed one the most highly anticipated for 2008 but was quite surprised the lower than low turnout the cinemas when watched jodha akbar was full house but wasn for tashan after watching knew why was entertaining but was fundamentally weak just like literal english title which means style tashan all style but little substance not that doesn have the usual star power but scenes felt forced and some bordered tad ridiculous even for bollywood standards must say which quite surprising given that tashan directed and written vijay krishna acharya who wrote dhoom and dhoom both which enjoyed tremendously his rookie directorial outing with tashan while you can fault his direction you probably scratch your head over the plot which was clunky best tried force too many things into the story though credit given where allowed you some avenue question character motivation but that came little too late and only toward the finale which left you guessing for just moment before latched into full blown action mimicking many thai action movie with hong kong wirework and hollywood ludicrous firearms and gunplay with zero recoil and bid include everything including the kitchen sink you have assortment vehicles appearing and the one that took the cake dhoom homage was the jetski boat the middle nowhere best tashan can enjoyed unintentional comedy and this attributed how the cast hammed with their characters saif ali khan plays jimmy cliff call center executive who gives english tuition only platform for fishing out new girlfriend material his playboy ways gets junked aside when meets with pooja singh kareena kapoor who not exactly who she seems the meek and sweet natured hottie she engages jimmy services for her boss mobster bhaiyyaji anil kapoor who probably gets most the laughs speaks broken english and phrases must like how beng does and complete the quartet akshay kumar plays bachchan pandey illiterate gangster for hire who got engaged bhaiyyaji hunt down jimmy and pooja when they escape with money stolen from bahiyyaji business begins road trip sorts with friends who turned enemies and enemies whom you know will become friends the road trip wears jimmy cliff probably the most implausible all because goes from zero hero executing moves that would shame rambo absolutely time which quite out character kareena kapoor amps the sex factor she uses her charms guile both men and has plenty opportunity given the much touted bikini scenes and other costumes that boast plunging necklines hemlines way above the knee every character has backstory created and thought akshay kumar bachchan pandey was probably the best the most touching and the most fun the lot even though his character seemed lot like non green incredible hulk with his gravity defying leaps and power packing punches his wounds also heal automatically which impressively puts wolverine shame and the best part his theme song which damn alpha male and played mode each time takes adversaries but sad say that the only tune that memorable something that cheers bachchan pandey bachchan pandey for most bollywood movies watch will usually able despite the obvious language gaps emerge from screenings humming tune two wasn able that after tashan because the songs unfortunately just weren catchy all usually the song dance routine works well into the storyline without any necessity bring the characters out the current scene location that enjoy versus plucking them out and plonking them into extreme settings high atop mountain atop jagged rocks the beach front tashan probably didn take itself too seriously but coming from vijay krishna acharya story you probably wanted something little more decent rather than the ridiculous and for continuity little more careful well billed blockbuster now can start understand why the crowds have already shunned this one despite akshay kumr stealing the show tashan could have been better the whole
