1 |text police story one jackie chan classic films that helped shape the hong kong cinema masterpiece that should not missed any action movie fan from the beginning obvious that jackie chan stunt team literally risked their live make this film both the action and the stunts are extremely realistic and innovative even today movie has outdone police story dangerous stunts many people were hospitalized police story including jackie chan the fighting not indisputably exceptional the stunts but the fighting this movie helped change and define jackie chan use props throughout the film chan uses odd object stop attackers and constantly throwing assailants through thick glass the action feels real because the stuntmen are giving the movie all they have give and jackie chan coordination outstanding the rest the aspects the film are not without flaws but they will not disappoint any action fan chan not only plays believable risk taking cop but shows the powerful changes that his character goes through falls into escalating desperation the plot powerful but modern viewer may find tedious times while the comedy will provide good number laughs does not always distract the audience from the lack action however for the time period was made the driving aspects the plot are entertaining there good number interesting and well played characters dispersed throughout the film well overall police story without doubt one the best action movies ever made and even hollywood the influences this one film are not ignored
