ongoing ghostly story the hypnotic steele well cast the ghostly love interest arturo dominici carmus and margarete robsahm julia many the tricks margheriti employs create the film eerie atmosphere cobwebs creaking doors fog etc are bound seem clich xc3 xa9 modern audience but they work far more effectively black and white than they ever could modern day colour rather than using body counts and special effects the film creates scares the old fashion way relying good story stylish direction fine set production interesting camera work and strong acting performances margheriti does marvellous job taking these elements and building the film suspense the horrifying paranormal secret the house gradually reveals itself the unwitting writer the film not without faults the pace drags the beginning the film ironically the minutes originally missed this probably worsened synapse films effort restore the film its original length though fans will likely appreciate the chance see the film restored terms the intro may have been more hindrance than help the english voice dubs are merely passable and the restored scenes the language shifts from english french english subtitles provided which sure annoying some viewers however synapse films deserves kudos for the quality the print clearly some effort was put into its restoration and deservedly enjoyed the film immensely and highly recommend aficionados italian goth films anyone who enjoys good ghost story rob rheubottom winnipeg canada
