rt townsend attempt poke fun while speak message about the film industry falters this because these small intermittent skits actually distract from the central focus the film and actually destroy internally while townsend seems trying make joke about life hollywood actually simply connecting every stereotype and clich xc3 xa9 the book what could have been beautiful satire transforms into simply generic humor that never quite stands apart from the rest you find yourself not laughing the humor this story perhaps there some comfort knowing that some the wayans brothers are around help spice this dull story wrong the wayans are this film but townsend demonstrates that has the ability even bring the worst out even this entertaining family definitely their pre living color moments see that comedy was something that all needed constantly improve upon perhaps was townsend direction just maybe this atrocious story but these typically funny comedians were obviously underused and ignored when came critics this film just thought that with the talent pool that townsend had pull from that hollywood shuffle would have been funny bright and true stab this obvious hollywood dilemma sadly was none the above finally would like say that this was workable film there were some moments while they were few and way far between that had smile face the final product just didn settle well with townsend can funny but this film just felt like was playing against himself instead through his personal experiences and troubles realize that was probably speaking the truth but never came through that instead are threaded through weak story which supports itself with idiotic flash clips that may have worked for sitcom but surely didn work for this film even for those that comment that this was his directorial debut and that was learning from this film would have disagree you are starting fresh either have tight script defined themes townsend had neither these and combined with the inability control his actors just failed ball flames overall this was rather disappointing watch reminded grade school spelling bee where finally your child time spell the word tough but the first two three letters come out you think that going work perfectly but then there that random and silent that forces your excitement come tumbling down that how felt with hollywood shuffle first saw the potential saw the theme and the motive behind the picture but through fuzzy and inexperienced technique and after the first couple scenes experienced that deep fall feeling townsend sank his own ship this one and don think hollywood shuffle will ever submerge pivotal moment hollywood cinema grade out
