1 |text the adventures barry mckenzie started life satirical comic strip private eye written barry humphries and based idea peter cook mckenzie bazza his friends lanky loud hat wearing australian whose two main interests life are sex despite never having had any and fosters lager 1972 found his way the big screen for the first two outings must have been tempting for humphries cast himself bazza but wisely left the job barry crocker later sing the theme the television soap opera neighbours humphries instead played multiple roles true peter sellers fashion most notably bazza overbearing aunt edna everage this was before she became dame you know this not going the importance being ernest when its censorship classification stands for poofters allowed pom hating bazza told sydney solicitor that order inherit share his father will must england absorb british culture with aunt edna tow catches quantas flight hong kong and then london over efficient customs officer makes bazza pay import duties everything bought over there including suitcase full tubes fosters lager puts when comes fleecing you the poms have got the edge the gyppos crafty taxi driver bernard spear maximises the fare taking bazza and edna first stonehenge then scotland the streets london are filthy and their hotel hovel run seedy landlord spike milligan who makes bazza put pound notes the electricity meter every twenty minutes there some good news for our hero though meets with other aussies earls court and fosters sale british pubs what happens next series comical escapades that take bazza from starring his own cigarette commercial putting curry down his pants the belief some form aphrodisiac bizarre encounter with dennis price upper class pervert who loves being spanked while wearing schoolboy uniform young conservative dance rickmansworth charity rock concert where his song about chundering vomiting almost makes him international star and finally the centre where pulls his pants down live talk show hosted the thinking man crumpet herself joan bakewell fire breaks out and bazza friends come the rescue downing cans fosters they urinate the flames masse this far cry from bruce beresford later works breaker morant and driving miss daisy release was savaged critics for being too vulgar well yes but also great non fun bazza disgusting creation but his zest for life unmistakable you cannot help but like the guy his various euphemisms for urinating point percy the porcelain and vomiting the technicolour yawn have passed into the english language without lot people knowing where they came from other guest stars include dick bentley detective who chases bazza everywhere peter cook julie covington later star rock follies and even future arts presenter russell davies sequel the wonderfully named barry mckenzie holds his own came out two years later its premiere humphries took the opportunity blast the critics who had savaged the first film good for him what must have been greater concern him though was the release crocodile dundee 1985 also featured lanky hat wearing aussie struggling come terms with foreign culture and made tonnes more money the song the end credits performed snacka fitzgibbon magnificent you have love lyric that includes the line you want send your sister frenzy introduce her barry mckenzie time end this review have the dunny shake hands with the unemployed
