1 |text 1993 with the success the first season batman the animated series warner brothers commissioned the team responsible for the hit show with producing feature length movie originally slated for direct video but bumped theatrical status would become known batman mask the phantasm ten years after phantasm have had additional three feature films released from the boys the sub zero return the joker and now mystery the batwoman joins the family the plot basic and many ways similar mask the phantasm new female vigilante modeling herself after batman has begun targeting operations run gotham mob boss rupert thorne and oswald cobblepot aka the penguin now batman must attempt unravel the mystery the batwoman before she crosses the line the animation the sleeker futuristic style that was utilized for batman the animated series fifth and sixth seasons aka the new batman adventures quite nicely done and just sleek return the joker animation there also some use cgi but minor compared the overabundance sub zero the music was alright different and exotic and similar the justice league score although the points the score when the old animated batman theme comes will sure send waves nostalgia through the older fans rodent shaped hearts kevin conroy always does wonderful job bruce wayne and batman also great have the old batman the animated series alumni back that includes bob hastings commissioner gordon robert costanzo detective bullock tara strong barbara gordon batgirl her cameo hints the romantic relationship between her and bruce that was mentioned batman beyond and efrem zimbalist alfred villains were also great especially given that rupert thorne the old mob boss from the original series appears for the first time since the fourth season overall while not quite reaching the standard set mask the phantasm ten years ago motb carries the torch quite nicely for the animated batman films and you have the dvd and are hardcore fan you will love the five minute short chase
