uccess spirited away was for kiki delivery service anna paquin and james van der beek yeah the dawson guy fill the lead roles mark hamill luke skywalker from star wars case you don know plays the villain and other roles are filled andy dick tres macneille the simpsons rugrats animaniacs michael mcshane friar tuck from kevin costner robin hood travesty and mandy patinkin hello name inigo montoya good for laugh few laughs really but watch the japanese one first
