1 |text roman polanski considered one the most important directors our time the mind behind classics such rosemary baby and chinatown probably what makes polanski cinema very interesting one the fact that while capable creating commercially attractive films such the afore mentioned masterpieces also fond making low key movies that are more personal nature locataire the tenant one those movies horror suspense story about paranoia and obsession that among his best works and probably among the best horror movies ever done polanski himself plays telkovsky young man looking for apartment france when finally finds one discovers that empty because the previous tenant simone choule attempted kill herself jumping out the window after simone dies the injuries trelkovsky begins become obsessed with her the point believing that her death was caused the rest the tenants the building while sharing the same claustrophobic feeling his other apartment themed films repulsion rosemary baby this film focuses the bizarre conspiracy that may may not entirely trelkovsky head the catastrophic effects the paranoia has his mind and the bizarre obsession has with the previous tenant trelkovsky descend into darkness portrayed perfectly polanski while first his performance seems odd and wooden slowly one finds out that polanski acts that way because trelkovsky meant acted that way simpleton with almost life who traps himself this maddening sub world that happens inhabited collection bizarre people the supporting actors really gave life the people the building creating memorable characters that are very important for the success the film also the beautiful cinematography polanski employs the film helps increase the feeling isolation and gives life the beautiful building that serves cage for trelkovsky the haunting images polanski uses convey the feeling confusion and madness are supernatural beauty that makes them both frightening and attractive flaw found the film that definitely bit slow first this may sound like turn off but fact the slow pace the beginning works perfectly mimics trelkovsky own boring life and how gradually enters different realm also the convoluted storyline definitely not easy one understand due the many complex layers has however more than flaw joy face thought provoking plot like this one while the tenant may not for everyone those interested psychological horror and surreal story lines will pleased the experience locataire really one roman polanksi masterpieces
