1 |text some happy coincidence the same year that jimmy stewart and kim novak made alfred hitchcock haunting masterpiece vertigo they also made this light comedy perhaps the two actors needed after undergoing the heaviness the hitchcock film any rate this great companion piece vertigo again explores very likely but powerful romance fact the film can seen the flip side vertigo with happy ending here again novak undergoes transformation vertigo she essentially plays two women and here she transforms from witch mortal stewart again bewitched and for awhile tormented his love for her unlike vertigo the two come together bell book and candle perfect antidote for the hitcock movie again the dynamics love and attraction are examined but altogether different vein the cast terrific lemmon hilarious novak warlock brother and elsa lancaster giving classic performance the aunt ernie kovacs the alcoholic cult writer and course hermoine gingold playing novak competitor are all great the scene with stewart drinking the potion comedy best anyone who has seen vertigo even you haven should see this memorable light comedy
