nd whilst watching you are conscious being witness the birth celebrated career her unconventional beauty and screen charisma one flounced did disdain quite like davis grab your attention from her first appearance whilst hers definitely the memorable performance the film leslie howard also excellent the sensitive and fragile student philip carey they are good combination though why why didn help her with that terrible terrible accent
