1 |text samurai sees sonny chiba and some other guys get transported back civil war stricken feudal japan for particular reason and much carnage ensues rather over the top essay sword machine gun that ultimately yields some interesting results the plot essentially runs along the rails that you might expect from the title initial fish out the water antics what this flying metal box etc etc aren better off here discussions and ultimately huge battle the latter proof that the film doesn take itself seriously all the carnage taking most the second half samurai army battles chiba platoon face off one would fully expect from the title but still manages overwhelm with its inventiveness and extravagance certainly one the most unique battle sequences its time and doesn drag despite its extended length chiba gives gruff performance iba initially good leader but someone who finally finds himself questioning his own morals the situation slowly has effect him this certainly one his better vehicles from his terrific the final act the two worlds have had such effect each other you have wonder was bit nihilism the part the writers they seem asking weren better off back then but this maybe reading bit much into was can generally described hugely entertaining two hours almost non stop action
