1 |text this wonderful new crime series bringing together three old stalwarts british television denis waterman james bolam and alun armstrong retired detectives brought back help clear old cases under the leadership younger career focused amanda redman the three quirky irritable old cops make brilliant team applying twenty year old detection methods police force which has moved long way since then sometimes with effect other times the horror their senior officers the three are portrayed sympathetically warts and all there are splendid comic scenes and some very moving ones each the three has come terms with growing old and the legacy their pasts the end the first six part series are promised further series next year each the characters had developed widower james bolam cannot come terms with his wife untimely death lothario denis waterman learning accept his role grandfather and even obsessive alun armstrong helped his new friends fight the demons his past and keep taking the medication while amanda redman has face the all too familiar conflict between having life and career the story lines have been interesting rather heavily dependent the wonders dna testing but the interplay four britain finest actors which has made the series unmissable
