1 |text have seen lot ppv the past but this the most entertaining intense ppv and the most complete dvd have ever seen the dvd extras are worth because they gives different view how the wrestlers act after the show such the chris benoit interview edge interview some glimpse into the monday night wars era the first match hogan winning tag title gold and some promotional talk additionally there good music video tag team table match bubby ray and spike dudley eddie guerro and chris benoit this was pretty good intense match start off the show not too many holds and just pure raw physicallity spike can hold his own tables matches and guerro and benoit gave good pure wrestling skills the mat wwe crusierweight championship jamie noble nidia billy kidman the crowd really didn care about either wrestler and didn get interested until kidman did shooting star press usually people expect lot high flying cruiser weight championship but this had very little fact was bad that when noble hit his finisher one even cared knew you can tell the lack camera flashing the ending was quick though wwe european championship jeff hardy william regal never really liked regal wrestler lacks intensity and style hardy was impressive but really didn get chance show off his high flying act although still performed some good counters and added that needed fast pace the match ended off quickly which was perfect for this match john cena chris jericho funny looking back cena very first ppv how used act how used dress and how used look watch his interview pretty funny this was good intense match with cena showing nice variety holds suplexes counters and some aerial jericho was sub par but definitely helped cena launch his career cena wins wwe intercontenital championship rvd brock lesnar this was very intense and good match both wrestlers styles really matched well the screen with brocks pure power and raw energy rvds skill full moves and quickness rvd looked great this match better than his later matches with edge and cena and the entire match was fast pace the ending worked perfectly because still preserved brock undefeated streak while giving rvd his just desserts his home state disqualification match booker big show another solid match that lacked certain intensity the rvd match but still good follow although started off kinda slow which always with big show booker was impressive and did sick move the announcers table the finisher was awesome the ending was great upset and big move for booker wwe tag team championship hogan and edge christian and lance storm this was mediocre match hogan comes out like usual huge pop but his variety moves lacks that intensity and energy then again christian doesn exactly have the greatest athletic abilities himself this ended being mediocre match best but was still for ppv triple threat match for the undisputed championship rock undertaker kurt angle easily the match the year this far the best triple threat match have ever seen had close falls plenty finishers stolen finishers raw energy intensity and fast pace one could predict who would come out this one your going buy this dvd would buy strictly for this match ending watch for yourself overall this was solid ppv with plenty extra goodies keep you watching again and again although this hard find had pay little more than usual for this dvd definitely worth your money
