1 |text the movie tells the tale prince whose life wonderful but after evil wizard tells him into town disguised beggar the wizard then locks the prince and soon becomes the shadow ruler baghdad the jailed prince meets thief called abu who helps him escape the jail and head town called basra where meets princess who falls madly love with but unbeknown him the evil wizard jafa also love with the princess and tries convince her father allow him marry her jafa soon learns that the prince trying win the girls heart makes him blind and turns abu into dog this leads the prince and abu going off adventure find way defeat jafa restore peace baghdad and marry the princess during their journey they encounter everything from sarcastic genies that takes abu flight through the clouds giant spider that really hungry and flying horse that probably gives birth one the most beautiful sequence these old eyes mine have ever seen this pure fantasy movie from start finish has flying horses genies flying carpets and wizards that can actually magic instead just hit people with their staffs doesn have any cheesy moments and the love story isn waste time the production designs are just stunning this movie from the palaces the different dangerous traps that the heroes encounter even though this movie over years old the production design far better than most the crap that gets tacked today cinema the music and songs are also well done anyone who sees will doubt hail want sailor sailing the seas one the great musical moments movies usually not huge fan singing movies since find them about enjoyable doing taxes but more than happy make exception for this movie what sells the movie for the sheer fact that you get see things you don see everyday life which also the same reason why love stuff like two towers and silent hill way before today modern fantasy movie came along with their realistic cgi blow our minds there was this movie which blew your mind without having green screen scattered all over the place one favorite shots two towers the one where see the trolls opening the black gates the main appeal that shot for was seeing these great fantasy beings doing what essentially manual labor and that what love about the genie and other creatures the movie they just there trying make living just like everyone else which gives them real feel even though they all just fantasy beings literally impossible watch this movie and not notice where the makers aladdin got their inspiration the characters from this movie are pretty much the same characters that movie from the talkative genie right down the flying carpet not entirely bad thing eyes since nice know that not the only one the planet that has deep passionate love for this amazing movie first saw this kid the motherland and thought was the greatest thing the world and upon watching again last week still think amazing that true testament that great movie can withstand the test time sure the effects look wee bit outdated and cheesy but was made way back the give break not everything looks outdated though since most the stuff can still hold its own today when scrutinized under today standard you ever wanted see live action version aladdin then you should get your wish with this but the angry cynical bunch will probably good avoiding this since this won their cup tea
