he story doesn extensive detail compared jackson version summary the ralph bakshi version lotr has superior overall atmosphere feels more like middle earth overall voice acting music really dig the fantasy score kont rosenman gandalf aragorn one the john hurt finest roles king theoden orcs black riders elrond not some fairy hippie this one while jackson version better because covers the whole story overall visuals and special effects gollum smeagol balrog hobbits lord the rings ralph bakshi even with well known shortcomings one the best animation films ever made and captures the atmosphere tolkien fantasy world very well not perfectly give score xc2 xbd out
