 are many ways which cgi distracts cgi works best when used for the fantastical when used create creatures who don exist nature for scientific magical spectacular when used substitute for natural locations disappoints there real sense wonder cgi mountain doesn have any the stateliness sense awe and foreboding that real mountain does know that the design this film was quite deliberate and wasn necessarily supposed look real but shouldn feel that way just didn for the weak and clich xc3 xa9d script homage excuse even had the movie had some thrills and dramatic tension might still have been enjoyable the last samurai was predictable the days the week and fan tom cruise but had everything that captain didn most notably drew the viewer into its world and made accept its rules and way being way that sky captain most definitely did not like see similar approach taken for films about comic book heroes the and the original jay garrick flash green lantern alan scott come mind being ripe for such treatment maybe the better more well known and fully realized characters that those character are would make for much better film would hard worse
