riod set decorations clarence steensen and art direction ted smith heinz roemheld did the music and milo anderson the gowns the film was ably directed action film specialist raoul walsh flynn also liked working with walsh but did not care for the other director worked for most often michael curtiz among the cast were ward bond john sullivan one his best performances lovely alexis smith bit spotty but intelligent the girl corbett loves and very able errol flynn corbett young man seemed relish playing later said was his favorite role from the period jack carson was his manager alan hale his charismatic father john loder rich foe with william frawley minor watson madeleine lebeau rhys williams arthur shields dorothy vaughn and mike mazurki along for the enjoyable proceedings hard say enough about the logic and light hearted fun this movie makers have generated one the best liked all sports biography films and standards one the most enjoyable well
