1 |text intriguingly bold film weaves the seemingly effortless camerawork with some superb casting and explosive soundtrack plot the damaging effects the crime and corruption the santiago underworld naive young brothers from the southern city temuco film debutant daniella rios the seductive erotic dancer gracia working the nightclub owned the face the new mini wave chilean film production alejandro trejo the elder brother played maturely nestor cantillana easily convinced become trejo lead henchman after night the stripclub celebrate younger brother victor juan pablo miranda seventeenth birthday from the establishing shot this opening scene the film explodes into neo noir exploration everything the outside world doesn usually expect see this country stereotypically conservative and catholic gracia charms seduction attract the three men like bees honey although the circular narrative the three way fantasy romance revolves around the linear portrayal major international drug deals between trejo men and the gringo eduardo barril power relations become vital theme society outsiders merge mini family the prostitute holds exotic spell over all the chilean men the film emerging from her ambiguous position the periphery society and seen holding the key all three men futures the relationships between trejo and cantillana become important the boys parents are conspicious their absence one assumes they still live temuco therefore trejo padrino who adopts cantillana and effectively makes him man the city miranda rapidly becomes the desperate outsider his dependency his father figure cantillana becomes increasingly strained jealousy over the beautiful gracia however miranda remains trapped the constraint still being school dependent cantillana who dependent trejo for the money survive trejo turn under the thumb the gringo and his wealth has been accumulated through drug deals and well his strip clubs the figure gracia acts time bomb viewed beautiful firework she wraps web beauty inside the patriarchy but the strain can only lead one climax the tensions these power relations come head gracia remains ambiguously elusive the viewer never sure which male figure she will commit the film concludes tragically and explosively shoot out which realigns power relations and erases half the major male protanganists the final shot miranda beaten face speeding down the panamericano highway despairingly powerful the boy has been sucked the lure the city underworld yet has lost his only visible family and his woman who his only friend the film has nothing the overriding metaphors are bold and brave this gangster film chile the notions family sex before marriage etc are abolished and instead the harsh realities the other side santiago coin are displayed all their savage glory trejo beats rios brutally rios and miranda make love cinema reel room whore having sex with minor she barely knows the gringos are seen have financial hold over this small latin american nation but not through the copper mines through the illegal path drugs waissbluth triumph his presentation this dark underworld which raises many social questions more perhaps than the record breakingly successful sexo con amor within slick smooth firecracker film which place this film firmly alongside sexo con amor taxi para tres and chacotero sentimental cinematic evidence that chile well and truly artistically alive and kicking the post transition period years after the censorship the military regime
