ady seen but setting the final scene more powerful the end the martyrdom joseph and hyrum portrayed and moviegoers are left ponder the events they just witnessed when first watched the movie assumed was made the church introduce joseph smith non members longer think that the case although hope the movie can just that insider find that the film celebration joseph and excellently reinforces the good things already know about him curious see how outsiders will view the film whether they will simply see propagandic epic story american religious man something else the film beautifully shot family friendly moving and hopefully something good for everyone that the events portrayed actually happened these united states america interesting ponder light the many aspects our culture including freedom religious expression and respect generally for the law moderns take for granted
