1 |text there something special about the austrian movies not only seidl but spielmann and other directors well this the piercing sense reality that never leaves the viewer throughout the movie hundstage exception this effect achieved not only the depicted stories but also actors playing hundstage have never had the feeling that these are actors playing but real people instead real the visceral feeling the viewer almost the grumpy pensioner lonely lady the movie are living below you your block any person living vienna can without any doubt painfully recognize the people the movie with their meckern sudern complaining their hidden sexual urges and the prolo macho guys this further reinforced the viennese dialect which according many especially made for complaining way life special parochialism and arrogance typical for vienna are also very well portrayed the viennese suburbs have vivid presence the movie with their stupor and drowsiness where nothing happens moreover they have been turned into celebration materialism with shopping malls and huge department stores inbetween are the houses the people where they indulge into what they reckon pleasure giving activities trying stay touch with their human selves yet vain the examples are the sexual game the old lady with the men which bordered rape the prolo guy losing his nerves and hitting his girlfriend and the young woman who hitchhikes and irritates her drivers the film has soundtrack concentrates the normality abnormality its images only another typical feature seidl and other austrian directors his showing disturbingly sexual images these include the stripping the old woman for her husband the sexual scenes the bath the sexual game the lady with the two men her apartment etc hundstage seild has portrayed the lives people who eventually may much viennese they could citizens paris new york madrid the viewers should not despise feel pity for the viennese the movie they themselves could become victims the same human estrangement and alienation albeit different circumstances the end believe seidl film warning about the terrible state human relationships brutally revealed hundstage and the viewer does not succumb the reasons for this evil transformation seidl has achieved his goal
