ersion had destroy this great bit music for many confess titanic buff such relished the opportunity see the ship never got see all its beauty perhaps watching sink affected more than some because had such interest the ship all life however doubt many those saw crying were titanic buffs applaud cameron for bringing this story the masses way that never demeaned the tragedy the film was made with such humanity another reviewer said better than ever could open your hearts titanic and you will not disappointed
