1 |text this good little shocker not perfect any stretch the imagination but tight competent and disturbing excellent example simple idea developed into compelling minute script the set requires bells and whistles lengthy exposition wordy back story kate franka pontente young german business woman living london drifts off whilst waiting for the last tube train she awakens find the place deserted but quickly comes realise that she far from alone someone something down there with her and intentions are wholly malicious fact she encounters several other characters her quest survive including lecherous work colleague homeless couple and caged sewage worker all whom add pace and substance the plot there slightly awkward gear change somewhere the middle the film when tension thriller mutates into gore fest but nothing clumsy slow the hectic pace for those you with weak dispositions this likely harrowing ride for those you who relish bit well executed carnal mayhem this should press all the right buttons the climax the film perhaps less successful than the main body the film but punctuated with nice moment unexpected social commentary which provides satisfying conclusion some may find themselves feeling somewhat cheated clear explanation the exact nature and history the threat encountered kate and her confederates however for this was not the case horror film writer should not need feel compelled dot every and cross every the same way writer political thrillers might expected there are enough clues here give you very pretty clear idea what brought this evil into existence making detailed and conclusive solution superfluous the retention certain sense mystery welcomed and reminds that this film the ride was always going more important than the exact destination understanding that the budget for this film was say the least minimal which case our applause for this british horror should all the louder for point does one have the impression corners being cut effects failing deliver this sounds like your kind film then probably buy ticket and climb aboard
