1 |text before there was crash there was this interesting film called grand canyon released about years sooner than the former film grand canyon was movie about two people from different backgrounds who come together friends over lifetime crash was still slightly better film but grand canyon was slouch either taking place los angeles upper class lawyer named mack kevin kline takes shortcut through the seedier side town only have his car break down the worst time calls for tow truck and has wait for awhile only soon threatened group dangerous people who want his car soon the tow truck driver arrives the perfect moment and out steps simon danny glover take the truck away both men are threatened but simon manages get himself mack and the car out dire straits from here out that friendship develops between the two men over lifetime with mack helping out simon just simon had helped him out dangerous situation earlier you see simon sister deborah tina lifford living dangerous neighborhood with her two children and fears for her oldest son who seems roaming the streets night with some bad people mack offers them better place live well hooking simon with his secretary friend jane alfre woodard this the main plot the film but there are other smaller plots involving the same secretary mentioned above mary louise parker well mack wife mary mcdonnel who discovers abandoned baby not long after their son roberto jeremy sisto his first movie role has gone camp for the summer and will likely moving with his own life soon the details all these plots are brought together into one complex movie which uses police helicopter metaphor for life and bridge entwine all the different scenes this simple plot device works very well and helps greatly with the flow the story the director lawrence kasdan whose biggest movie this date was the big chill has created splendid movie here the cast excellent and most the ideas are well thought out but alas falls short greatness because some points that would made the film even stronger are glossed over the story involving the secretary one and the second involving simon nephew the other these scenes should been more apart the entire story and then maybe lawrence kasdan views life between the upper and lower classes would been more superior level instead just very good still grand canyon exceeded expectations and yes you will get see view the canyon that this movie was named after there also small role for steve martin davis producer violent films who offers his own views life and has small part play this movie ideas
