low meandering river and beautiful watch the natural landscapes the are accentuated and together with the beautiful soundtrack angelo badalamenti makes yearn america the performances are also excellent with every actor believable their roles and richard farnsworth particularly excellent his oscar nomination was greatly deserved and was shame that didn win regardless however probably the finest swan song for any actor whilst the straight story features none lynch complex narratives trademark dialogue the film fascinating character study about getting old and comes highly recommended
