1 |text the perfect son story about two something brothers one who seemingly perfect and the other who basically screw frequently landing himself drug rehab centers after the death their father the two are brought together after long absence and the usual sibling rivalry resurfaces isn until the perfect brother makes the startling revelation that has aids that the irresponsible younger brother finally makes move get his life order and take some responsibility the movie does nice job chronicling the younger brother comeback though may seem bit far fetched times beating drug addiction never easy what makes the film more tender the treatment aids topic that has become somewhat passe cinema over the last years and also the development almost sweet relationship between the two formerly feuding brothers very believable and well done the two main actors were both very competent not terribly charismatic solid first feature effort from director and writer leonard farlinger whose own brother died aids the ending nicely done well
