1 |text this was wonderful little american propaganda film that both highly creative and openly discusses the nazi atrocities before the entire extent the death camps were revealed while late 1944 and into 1945 would reveal just how evil and horrific they were this film unlike other hollywood films date the most brutally honest film the era have seen regarding nazi atrocities the film begins courtroom the future after the war over the film was made 1944 the war ended may 1945 this fictitious world court nazi leader being tried for war crimes wilhelm grimm totally unrepentant and one one witnesses are called who reveal grimm life since 1919 series flashbacks first appears that the film going sympathetic explain how grimm was pushed join the nazis however after while becomes very apparent that grimm just sadistic monster these episodes are amazingly well done and definitely hold your interest and also make the film seem less like piece propaganda but legitimate drama all all the film does great job considering the film mostly stars second tier actors there are many compelling scenes and performances especially the very prescient jewish extermination scene towards the end that can help but bring you close tears was also interesting how around the same point the film there were some super creative scenes that use crosses way you might not notice first overall must see for history lovers and anyone who wants see good film fyi this not meant serious criticism the film but hitler was referred that paper hanger this reference the myth that hitler had once made money putting wallpaper this fact not true previously been starving artist homeless person and served well the german army wwi horrible person yes but never paper hanger
