th her she pens note emotions bud after sneaking clean his house during their break the supporting cast was incredible wes played scott glenn gave first rate performance that made you hate him and curse him abused sissy madolyn smith osborne buds mistress girlfriend was authentic that large chested girls across the prayed wake flat chested wear the clothes she donned the film biggest kudos barry corbin and brooke anderson bud aunt and uncle they seemed like someone aunt and uncle somewhere texas and however small their role they made the film much bigger and lifelike two memorable scenes were the dolly parton contest and the unforgettable scene where bud and his aunt stand outside after one the characters death the dialog between them touching you can watch this for what true american love story then recommend that you take for what film before time that gave voyeurism into world unlike our own but real enough for our enjoyment and entertainment this world sounds similar yours then you will enjoy much more lastly the music however dated sure send you back time you are over years age
