1 |text coda dello scorpione case the scorpion tail was director sergio martino follow the wonderful giallo strano vizio della signora wardh this the quintessential giallo featuring all the aspects fans the genre have come know and love twisty plot beautiful girls black gloves sharp blades and bit gore all come together make one heck piece italian exploitation group gialli favorites both front and behind the camera work make this one the best non argento gialli around there the aforementioned martino adding his touches director giallo great ernesto gastaldi the writer bruno nicolai creating the music and host giallo stars and starlets such george hilton character actor luigi pistilli and the fetching anita strindberg with all this talent behind does scorpione deliver you bet the film works many different levels thrilling murder mystery tense and violent horror film and suspenseful thriller all all one the best gialli around martino definitely knows what fans want when comes gialli some points the film almost seems channeling argento his approach for example there direct rip off the scene bird with the crystal plumage where the killer tries break through the door that actually outdoes argento flick are there any problems with the flick hmmm only minor ones first any scenes that aren following the murders the budding romance between the two leads begin bore but just before you fall asleep the killer will pop out nowhere and you right back the swing things also towards the end the twists get little too bizarre mean what purpose did the scorpion pins really serve you don play close attention the dialogue you could easily become lost with the twisting weaving storyline but these minor quibbles aside coda dello scorpione tense suspenseful classy and all around entertaining film for giallo fans seek out
