1 |text addictive adjective heard many times when talking certain shows most recently dramas like lost heroes and prison break have earned that description however compelling they may and they really are can wait few days before see the next episode either series even prison break which some have lazily classified the new with all due respect there can such thing and for good reason other silver screen thriller based real time structure that what sets apart from any other show and that why practically have watch entire season dvd seven days less once the frickin clock starts ticking impossible tune out episode whose events unfolded over the course single day was trademark nypd blue and more recently deadwood having entire season new series last hours one per the actual running time minutes the remaining are occupied commercials when the show airs telly was the most groundbreaking idea mainstream television since hill street blues introduced non linear storytelling mandatory element nowadays and truly paid off ironically enough the original plan for the series was make revolve around wedding fortunately creators joel surnow and robert cochran realized the format was more suitable for conspiracy thriller which probably the reason the first glimpse get the hero suggests cheerful atmosphere looking extremely relaxed jack bauer kiefer sutherland enjoying game chess with his daughter kimberly elisha cuthbert and minutes later being tender with teri leslie hope the wife with whom has just reconciled the sopranos though something unexpected and shocking just behind the corner not only has kim snuck out her room jack also receives phone call urging him get work immediately midnight afraid bauer ctu counter terrorist unit agent and his boss has acquired reliable intel about possible hit the life david palmer dennis haysbert african american presidential candidate who will los angeles for the whole day right almost forgot events occur the day the california presidential primary time for napping then jack has spend the next hours working the case unfortunately has tendency ignore protocol and that doesn sit well with george mason xander berkeley slimy man from division who has been asked interfere with the operation the plot very dense making the show hard recommend for those with short attention span but anyone willing take look will rewarded instantly the writing sharp and precise the attention detail unsurpassed and the suspense consistently sky high mainly thanks the real time trickery which considerably enhances the adrenaline level another great quality this pilot the characterization most genre shows sci and thriller tend simply introduce the key players and then define them later textbook example csi where character development minimal but then again that matches the show unique style whereas the series debut offers rich array fully rounded people among whom jack sutherland best role ever and palmer the real revelation the show stand out for being perfectly described after one episode only the former divided between job and family reckless but humane the latter honorable and endowed with great integrity couple supporting parts border stereotype mason and tony almeida especially but two factors ought taken into account this the first episode there much going most viewers won even complain about flaw two after all how many network programs manage begin with conspiracy missing teenager and huge explosion and still have equally satisfying material for the rest the season tick tock tick tock
