-1 |text the fox and the child the new film french director luc jacquet who brought the oscar winning documentary march the penguins focuses around young girl wonderfully played bertille xc3 xabl bruneau and her blooming friendship with fox there are some truly mesmerizing moments here badgers mucking about lynx chasing the fox through snow littered forest one scene particular when the fox being tormented pack wolves quite intense and even frightening times however there simply not quite enough them beautifully shot the cinematography dazzling the bubbly kind look the film wonderful undeniably very lush production the english version narrated kate winslet but what little dialogue there already has been very poorly dubbed the score also far too fluffy least for liking and the screenplay while subtle seemingly jumps from one scenario another ultimately leaving almost baffled while there nice moral the heart the film and the rather quiet performance from xc3 xabl bruneau quite lovely the real star the fox those captivating moments focusing solely around our furry little friend are tremendous however again there simply not nearly enough them keep date with all the latest film including reviews news discussions and more sure visit www mybluray com
1 |text cliffhanger decent action crime adventure with some flaws from director renny harlin whose admirable making this movie about expert climber who finds himself taken hostage with fellow friend gang dangerous criminals the search for suit cases full stolen cash the rocky mountains sylvester stallone impressive gabe walker the expert climber especially the action fight sequences but some them definitely border the line unrealistic for the sake the film though willing suspend disbelief the rest the cast including john lithgow michael rooker janine turner rex linn caroline goodall and leon are respectable the supporting characters the movie the action fight sequences are well executed but mentioned before some aren very realistic matter how tough you are the climbing sequences however are very well done because instead doing the whole film studio somewhere the locations they chose felt very real and the ariel views the mountain ranges are marvelous adding touch reality the movie the deaths are inventive while others are sort predictable the villains are solid but would been better they had focused more central one instead having many them the pacing the movie was little slow but the good outweighs the bad this one you big fan harlins stallone than chances are you enjoy this one too overall cliffhanger has character development with enough action drama some suspense excitement thrills and good performances the cast who make this movie worth the time watch
