iard cannot just allow this story take place continually introduces more characters one just seedy the next even our rock our solid foundation with the parole officer question when his wife goes missing xc2 x96 subplot this film that first angered but upon further debate was staple finale for this film yet none this could have happened weren for our characters devos solemn and homely look breathtaking she changes her image for paul the truth her beauty discovered paul the wildcard the film continues seemingly use and abuse the friendship for his final endgame then just assume one carla takes one last shape audiard knows has amazing actors capturing his characters cassel and devos could just play cards the entire time and would still sitting the end chair the story probably the weakest part this film first random the interwoven stories seem unconnected first but audiard lets them connect bit bit again the entire parole officer segment was tangent but that final scene just solidified the ends the means not attempting sound vague but this complex yet utterly simple story difficult explain there plenty happening but you connect the pieces favorite scene when carla attempting discover where some money being held that use sound and scene was brilliant was tense was dramatic and was like watching who dun mystery unfold before your eyes overall initially though this was mediocre french film that could easily forget about when was over xc2 x96 was proved wrong read lips opens the floor for discussion not just with the characters but the situations one will find themselves rooting for carla one scene and paul the next when discovery made paul apartment carla found myself deeply angry audiard brought true emotion the screen with his characters and development and what was lacking plot xc2 x96 the actors were able carry can easily suggest this film anyone but prepared this isn one time viewing film repeat repeat repeat grade out
