1 |text scream was wes craven last decent thriller since then there has been nothing but unbearable streak hollywood trash barely good enough for blockbuster night including the disappointment the scream sequels perhaps the genius and the craftsmanship devoted the movie drained all the energy and creativity out him that when came time for supper had nothing serve but his own doo doo finally after who knows how many bad movies later gives delicious ruthless gripping chilling suspense thriller with red eye rachel mcadams once again delivers enjoyable performance she plays hotel manager who has the unfortunate connection with important political figure and regular her hotel then she meets jackson ripner cillian murphy batman beyond the airport who she gets know little better after delayed flight and bay breeze what she doesn know already knows her and also knows her father who she will never see again she fails cooperate and meet jackson demands use her connections set her hotel regular for assassination you probably thinking this nothing but your everyday thriller complete with predictability and chase scenes although this good old fashioned thriller that the beauty special effects cheap make just classic suspense you feel the desperation and regret with every decision mcadams forced make and you actually care for her you cheer her every move she makes find escape from her claustrophobic position always she delivers entertaining and convincing performance either her sweet face her uncanny ability sincerely cry but you always seem sympathize with her her role demands cillian murphy the other hand naturally creepy looking even the trailer didn reveal his ultimate transition from charming stranger merciless jackass isn surprising perhaps would have been more trippy see nice guy persona like toby maguire transforming into evil relentless madman nevertheless cillian murphy after his true identity established played the role solidly you really want him die least get his ass kicked don overlook this feature there are plenty chalkboard screeching moments and heart jumpers that will keep your eyes the screen instead your watch like you would craven recent pictures not for the you for all the times you see your girlfriend boyfriend someone with popcorn jump and cling you wes finally gets right aside from his trademark mastery suspense red eye not without its humor mcadams replacement cynthia the front desk fumbles keep the hotel order was relief that red eye wasn disappointment instead you get the pleasure seeing mcadams deliver another incredibly talented performance murphy look creepier the minute and craven craft classic traditional thriller flight that was delayed and would have been the beginning craven renaissance had arrived right after scream
