y come terms with their mutual feelings towards the end the film nobody surprised and nobody really cares either props the director for appreciating bai ling enough dress her skintight vinyl for the entirety the film and also for the intriguing sepia tones that served coloration throughout but sky captain despite having all the essential elements being great movie falls flat its face not even worth the paid get into the theater
