1 |text gundam wing amazing show from start finish every single episode joy watch the story typical gundam fare the future earth populations grows the extent where create space colonies order expand the story though set entirely different reality than any other gundam show the year after colony 195 and the corrupt earth government known the earth sphere alliance violently taking over the free colonies combat the alliance control and the even greater threat that come evil militaristic organization hiding within the alliance known which later takes control earth and the colonies select members the colonies send super powerful mechs earth try and save the colonies from the threat that soon come these mechs known gundams fight and try regain peace the colonies takes the front stage completely eliminating the alliance and taking control earth and its colonies gundam wing previously stated probably the most enjoyable gundam series watch opinion large part this reason the difference between this series and any other gundam series before but also the stories are far more deep and intricate than majority the other gundam series gundam wing has more depth and emotion than any other gundam show have ever seen thus far this particular series seemed focus more character and the relationships amongst those characters than epic space battle now don get wrong this show still has many epic battles within and the show still maintains the epic atmosphere that other gundam series have but achieves this having the story follow ensemble cast characters opposed following just matter how you look this truly one the most unique and enjoyable gundam series out there and strongly recommend any fan anime sci general the show sports some amazing animation and superb action but the depth and intricacy the story what keeps you coming back for more the characters are well drawn out the end the show that you end loving each and every one them this show definitely one that shouldn missed perfect
