 with his life rather than violate the spoiler rules revealing much more will simply say that there are great deal twists and turns behind the scenes skullduggery and other difficulties for achilles and his fellow jox before the two robotic titans clash finally once again the finale hope not making this movie out some sort masterpiece science fiction because isn robot jox just plain fun grant that bit higher concept than your average grade sci movie and though the budgetary constraints occasionally make themselves known especially the scenes involving some painfully obvious green screen trickery still the best looking movie ever come out the empire full moon pictures factory the robot fight scenes are very well done using old school stop motion model techniques and the sets and costumes don look half assed the slightest empire pictures and director stuart animator gordon were definitely shooting for the stars with this picture unfortunately didn quite pan out for them the studio but least got one heckuva cool little movie out the deal bottom line you want aurally and visually assaulted for hours feel free rent transformers movie the end you likely feel like you spent all that time watching someone else play video game you want have rock sock robot good time pick robot jox instead
