1 |text the often misunderstood zabriskie point antonioni political film antonioni american film stylistically follows suit after blow meaning that the pace faster than the previous epics though certainly less idiosyncratic basically the common mistake that the film glorifies the hippie generation not the two protagonists come from vastly different environments mark from the rebel youths daria from estate agency corporation but true antonioni fashion they are both alienated both trying escape their surroundings mark leaves meeting rebel students and black panthers disappointed with the verbose empty rhetoric while daria keeps uneasily being the move with her car antionioni the master director after portraying the rebelling youth confused and shallow then moves the city environment saturated corporatism billboard advertisements meaninglessness that has keep expanding accommodate the similar expansion the population generating profit the same time this environment that the two protagonists escape from though seems mostly out coincidence indeed when daria stops small village the outskirts the desert the environment just suffocating and the people just lost cases best exemplified old boxing champion now reduced shadow himself sitting around drinking and smoking and talking nonsense stunning melancholy sequence made even more powerful with the inclusion some half wild children living around brought some benefactor but destroying genuine piece american history not obscure symbolism there antonioni opinion the hippies just half positive glimpse the canvas human alienation and then there the desert the landscape used devastating effect turns pure and terrifying primeval wild and dead the sequence where the two protagonists make love joined fantasy the flower generation reflects the similar sequence red desert where giuliana tells her son story colourful intermission colourless landscape vivid half fantasy suffocating reality the ending probably belongs the pantheon great endings cinema the western civilization blown pieces catharsis exorcism antionioni two international films the british blow and the american zabriskie point are lesser efforts than the previous masterpieces but that largely because the faster pace and the inevitably contrived settings swinging london flower power america but when comes down clear hasn lost the edge
