tel than you most likely will appreciate this lesser known classic was especially impressed the extra attention details the whole segment where emy takes george her fathers house the island really nice her father shows george and the viewer his impressive collection bonzai trees has whole miniature forest built out these amazing trees totally unexpected after catching late night cable years ago spent much time searching the internet for copy the film when finally got found that the video version was longer more sex more melodrama for the dvd release there subplot about george suddenly keeling over with some unknown deadly disease actually preferred the cable version better glad that this rare gem has been released finally dvd must also mention the beautiful cinematography and the bizarre and catchy soundtrack while watching this one you just get the feeling that you are watching something very rare and quite special recommend thoughtful viewers who don need sex and violence maintain their interest
