1 |text have hand the creative team behind these american pie movies direct dvd typically synonymous with cheap incompetent film making yet last year was pleasantly surprised when found myself thoroughly enjoying the dvd sequel the naked mile the filmmakers took advantage the opportunity deliver raunchy yet funny little film this year they offer the followup beta house this the honest truth beta house makes the first few american pie movies look like the little mermaid this holds barred tasteless laugh out loud fun sure the story bit thin but that the beauty the whole thing within the first minutes introduced the all the main characters the new supporting characters get handful raunchy gags meet the villains and establish the general plot line with all that out the way the movie becomes limits ride the gags are plenty and they did not hold back this one talking male semen urine dildos chicks with dicks sex with sheep female orgazim sprays and plenty more not mention the fact that not minute goes without boobs sex scene returning from the naked mile are john white jake siegel steve talley and eugene levy similar supporting role the last few films the entire cast does fine work steve talley dwight stifler particular has great energy and screen presence predict good things for him the film also loaded with great movie references for those who keep their eyes open far the biggest laugh the film for was the deerhunter parody classic the bottom line you fan the series you feel right home with beta house really pushes the limits good taste but the end pretty damn funny
