1 |text the significance french title this film naissance des pieuvres which literally means the birth the octopuses rather obscure perhaps not surprising that has been marketed english speaking countries water lilies the lilies the english title are three teenage girls marie anne and floriane who are members synchronised swimming team based the paris suburbs and the film coming age drama about the development their first sexual feelings one feature the film perhaps unusual for film this type that concentrates exclusively relationships between the young people themselves see nothing their parents their teachers and very little the adult world all the three girls are very different appearance and are portrayed being very different character the shy retiring marie slim and petite and appears the youngest the three anne something plain jane floriane glamorous blonde who very popular with the boys the three together with handsome male swimmer named francois are involved what might described love quadrilateral anne has fallen love with francois but smitten with floriane who seems return his affections although means her only male admirer indeed not all floriane admirers are male because marie has crush her attractive friend the film charts the way which their friendship develops first seems that floriane simply using marie convenient excuse when she fact going out meet boys her parents presumably object her dating boys but have objection her going out with female friends later however realise that despite floriane image the sexy popular girl who always the centre male attention she actually reciprocates marie feelings the film reverses some conventional stereotypes about sexuality anne with her short hair and rather chunky figure looks typically butch yet she the only one the three main characters who unambiguously heterosexual whereas the more conventionally feminine marie and the glamorous floriane are lesbian least bisexual coming age films are common enough although most them tend avoid the controversial topic teenage lesbianism water lilies however deals with its subject matter sensitive way with three very good performances from its three leading actresses pauline acquart adele haenel and louise blachere the relationships between the characters especially that between marie and floriane are complex and capable number interpretations floriane for example simply using marie for sex does she genuinely have romantic feelings for her could floriane sluttish behaviour with francois and the other boys just device hide her lesbian feelings from the outside world even hide them from herself this was the first film made its young director celine sciamma only the time this basis she must regarded highly promising newcomer
