hes quotable dialogue the various verbal duels are concerned but the field unspoken reaction she really outclassed her male supporting leads fairbanks particular absolute treat number wordless sequences whose set and humour worthy the silent screen this film too uneven style classic varying from sparkling repartee hackneyed tedium but its best quite honestly very funny indeed and brought round spontaneous applause and laughter across the auditorium the end the lights went out tune with its times may have failed draw contemporary audiences but this showing really didn deserve disowned both grable and preminger the uncredited director this masterpiece but thoroughly entertaining minor work and for one found myself grinning remembrance all the way home
