1 |text freebird the perfect marriage road trip comedy gang caper stoner film and feel good british movie the brilliant lead characters that set this movie apart from other films this genre stars phil daniels gary stretch and geoff bell have great chemistry and make their characters hugely likable and realistic the main story centres around their road trip from london wales and the adventures and mishaps that occur along the way this small film also has great heart not just for bike fans bases around the character relationships with each other including dreams and regrets such gary stretch fred longing for the family left behind the cinematography also great love letter the welsh countryside well capturing the grittiness london streets and typical pub life the welsh country towns stylish slick fantastic soundtrack likable characters and funny storyline would recommend freebird heartbeat
