al techniques unique strange and completely different from anything you will see from hollywood nowadays any other dream factory for that matter europa essential movie the lars von trier catalog some write off pure commercial speculation but that would catastrophic right there with other trier classics and semi classics such forbrydelsens element from 1984 the series riget from 1993 and dogville from 2003 unique experience from before trier cared for his actors and before the dogme95 manifesto watch the count ten
