1 |text managed catch late night double feature last night before sunrise 1995 and before sunset 2004 and saw both films row without really having the chance catch breath between ponder the meaning each film separately after sleeping over have say that largely prefer the former over the latter and shall explain why before sunrise introduces with then young actors ethan hawke reality bites dead poets society only the time the film release and julie delpy the three colors trilogy then although looking much younger promiscuous american writer touring europe after breaking with his girlfriend she young french student her way home paris they meet the budapest vienna train and spontaneously decide get off the train together the two deeply spiritual and intellectual individuals than spend whole night together walking the beautifully captured streets vienna exchanging ideals and thoughts and gradually falling love the film has 1990 written all over back then technology was leaping rapidly the new millennium with all hopes and dreams was waiting just around the corner and young adults like the ones depicted the film were filled with love life and passion for the future the characters jesse hawke and celine delpy with all their flaws and inconsistencies celine accent mistake purpose was half american half french and swinged from one spectrum the other breaking the character credibility were mirror the time watching the naive couple swallow life with such meaning and excitement acting all clich xc3 xa9d and romantic yet managing have the audience fall for them well what really made this movie work for the fact that the director doesn let you know their relationship continues after the film not makes all even more worth while all all sunrise dreamy stroll through the urban landscapes vienna well told classical romantic rendezvous and film will definitely return for further insight sometime the future
