as and heather was non existent and that damaged the film because their relationship felt phony can usually rely molly shannon funny supporting role but here she was just annoying sissy spacek had about two scenes and she was annoying both them finally alan cumming just had embarrassing character and his performance wasn very good overall gray matters lame film and isn worth watching rating
