1 |text really touching story recruitment camp america where young men are prepared for the vietnam war the human study always appealed when comes war movies because translates personal subjective opinions war opposed war action movies where action and technical data are being analyzed the prejudice the human factor the movie manages put new spin already ancient subject and manages distance itself from usual war movies especially focusing anti hero from the view point traditional standard the movie focuses the tragic character bozz who smartly avoids being sucked the dehumanizing war machine and refuses give control over his destiny and fight for something doesn believe spends his energy searching ways avoid being sent overseas both for himself and comrades and ironically ends finding his own just reason for finally going war perfect irony the acting truly exceptional and the documentary style shooting almost makes you feel transposed into the movie also the movie will provide food for thought for those exhilarated the action usual war movies war games enthusiasts hopefully awakening some minds generation which luckily escaped the terror being drafted
