lf censorship that would soon engulf the entire industry mgm yanked gibbons from the production the official reason given was his workload art director and veteran jack conway was listed the new director appease the critics although james mckay actually directed the film conway was busy other projects including viva villa the film incorporated the best elements the original safaris murderous tribes tarzan fighting jungle beasts the death save jane and actually improved the storytelling harry holt neil hamilton from the first film returns africa for ivory from the elephants graveyard and try seduce jane into returning england with gifts silk dresses underwear and perfume brings with him martin arlington paul cavanagh crack shot and inveterate womanizer who sneers holt chivalrous pursuit jane and stalks her potential conquest had any means including killing tarzan and when can get away with without being seen tarzan barely tolerates the intrusion into his happy life with jane and puts his foot down refusing allow the hunters into the graveyard arlington finds his opportunity catching the ape man alone and shoots him then returns the camp with fabricated story his demise now jane has reason remain the jungle and she can direct them the graveyard before her long voyage back england comforted the sympathetic arlington but savage tribe and hideous torture await the group can tarzan being nursed back health his ape family recover time save jane while stock footage again used extensively the racial stereotypes the 30s are apparent and the gorillas are obviously actors ape suits tarzan and his mate achieves level sophistication unsurpassed any other tarzan film well sexiness that even derek blatantly erotic tarzan the ape man couldn touch johnny weissmuller was peak condition physically maureen sullivan was never more beautiful and africa never looked more romantic and dangerous tarzan and his mate was triumph although would drastically edited for many years and remains the classic the series this day
