1 |text from the upper shelf great classic books comes this masterful story written pearl buck the book like the movie called the good earth relates the story wang lung paul muni simple chinese farmer who begins his day with trip the great house where has taken slave woman called lan luise rainer and made her his wife almost from the beginning she begins adapt his kindness saving small peach seed and planting near her new home during the following years lan proves her worth steadfastly sharing her husband toil troubles and changing fortunes through the passing years they raise family and watch their simple household weather both feast and famine indeed the lowest point their lives that each discovers the value companionship loyalty and love with the changing times their growing family both aided and threatened with friends and relatives like their uncle walter connolly who scoundrel and charlatan but compassionately tolerated wang has his old father charley grapewin advise and remind him life fragile and fickle nature two notable actors who make impressive appearances this film are keye luke who plays wang elder son and phillip ahn who plays nationalist soldier the film black and white and wonderfully adapted from the novel highly recommended for all audiences
