1 |text who says zombies can converted into useful members the community certainly not the makers fido who take never never land version the 1950 where the undead have been turned into butlers and servants for the burgeoning middle class timmy robinson the all american boy who becomes emotionally attached the family new full time domestic recently resurrected zombie whom timmy has affectionately dubbed fido all this has been made possible zomcom big brother type organization that has found way render the zombies who were originally brought life radiation from outer space manageable and docile least most the time this twisted modern day spin the series lassie might easily have been entitled boy and his zombie takes slyly satirical swipes such pre 60s concerns obsessive social conformity here keeping with the joneses means having more zombie servants than the folks next door the sterility suburban life the corporate control civic affairs small town corruption and nuclear family values all played out beautifully designed setting parti colored houses and immaculately manicured lawns the movie doesn hit the audience over the head with its message nor does engage endless hyperbole generate laughs instead this low keyed subtle little satire that elicits appreciative chuckles rather than full bellied guffaws much the humor derives from the incongruity between the placidness the setting and the cavalier attitude towards death demonstrated the fine citizens the community life magazine has been replaced with periodical entitled death magazine despite some playfully graphic violence the movie stays true the spirit innocence generally associate with both the 1950 itself and the cheesy low budget horror movies that were much part the pop culture scene that decade sun ray carrie ann moss and dylan baker are amiable and appealing the wide eyed timmy and his cleaver esquire parents with slightly sinister undertones while billy connolly accomplishes the well nigh impossible task bringing great deal humanity and depth the role resurrected corpse this what lassie might have been had timmy best friend been afflicted rabies
