1 |text admittedly know nothing about baseball not even fan the sport but that didn stop enjoying the farrelly brothers latest film fever pitch charmingly irreverent romantic comedy the film not really about baseball rather really about relationships and the emotional disconnectedness that can often take place jimmy fallen xc2 x96 giving his best performance date xc2 x96 stars ben dorky lightly nerdy schoolteacher ben kind man boy who unfortunately has never really grown and fosters almost fanatical addiction the red sox baseball team ben has devoted his life the sox and does everything from making the pilgrimage florida for spring training decorating every square inch his apartment team paraphernalia one day while taking his honors geometry class field trip her office ben meets the getting lindsey wonderful drew barrymore lindsey corporate career orientated kind girl but she has kind cuteness that ben finds totally endearing initially hesitant ask her out thinking that she way out his class and lindsey doesn immediately see potential partner ben their first date gets off disastrous start when lindsey stricken with severe case food poisoning xc2 x97 and her resonant retching provides the first clue that are fact watching farrelly brothers movie rather than accept lindsey rather urgent request reschedule ben sticks around play nurse orderly and janitor ben scrubs the toilet and the dog teeth while his love interest passed out with bucket next her bed when lindsey wakes the morning and finds him asleep her couch she begins the long fitful process dismantling the web status anxiety and ambition she has come think her standards soon they are falling love with lindsey blithely accepting ben fanatical devotion his sport having inherited choice season tickets from his beloved uncle ben has organized his life around the season xc2 x97 never missed game but their relationship which has progressed without hitch throughout the winter hits snag the start the season lindsey wants ben other things like holiday with her parents and party with her friends but ben begins have trouble modulating his interest meet lindsey halfway can lindsey consent his irrational devotion the boys summer order make their relationship work can she really accommodate ben infatuation with sports can die hard and nerdy red sox fan find true love after all course lindsey and ben come with colorful assortment opinion wielding friends lindsey strictest buddy the skinny rich and blond robin kadee strickland insists that there must something wrong with the guy still single however plump curly haired sarah marissa jaret winokur and molly ione skye supply more optimistic and positive view ben ben eccentricity could applied virtually any obsessive sports fan while lindsay frustrations could representative any upwardly mobile career driven woman fallon terrific ben exhibiting real big screen potential overcoming the not insignificant challenge keeping ben from being unsympathetic barrymore meanwhile equally charming the workaholic lindsey particularly she struggles accept ben for who without losing sight her own needs fever pitch really works and even though there are lots inspired comedic moments the movie also addressing the serious problem sports addiction and how difficult can for couples negotiate this fragile territory much the movie was filmed boston fenway park which adds fine sense authenticity the proceedings well the ambiance the games though fully appreciating what transpired with the team will probably limited baseball aficionados even fever pitch blessed with such finely wrought and intelligently funny script that even novice baseball fans will find much with which connect mike leonard september
