t which are turned into believable extraordinary events that allow the two possible lovers meet again for example the next time some bird poo from the sky drops onto book paper yours consider your alternatives two characters make obvious choice that must occur before irene and her man destiny meet again what about stone chip flying onto your windscreen consider again what would happen all that interesting enough what was more interesting for was assessing each new man who came along and trying decide whether this guy was the one for irene whether was fact the young man the train that kept guessing for while let you think about that should you see this delightful romp recommended for all
