1 |text antwone fisher story childhood neglect and abuse inspiration all among who witnessed even experienced the plight foster children abandoned troubled mother antwone has never met his father growing with church going abusers who use the word not only intimidate and hurt but also term endearment young man witnessing how his best friend killed hold enduring racial slurs and being teased while serving the navy antwone anger slowly turned into positive power when counseled navy psychiatrist and love enters his life the scene where antwone meets his birth mother one the most powerful moments the film stunned the unexpected confrontation the woman listens silence hear the young man tell her how has lived life without crime addictions drugs fathering children left and right all despite his utterly adverse circumstances that scene wasn powerful enough the very next one drives home and opens the flood gates reception welcome home antwone dozens smiling faces and open arms announcing that part this great family one the messages delivered this wonderful film that there are many well meaning and sincere people working help orphans and unwanted children even some the homes and administrators don seem care and appear self serving many give their all the character who found antwone file once disclosed the circumstances his birth one those bright lights the darkness the system the dvd includes french language track various subtitle choices well additional features and information about foster parenting clevelander appreciated the location footage matter where you are from you will deeply moved this autobiographical gem
