ur shakespearian tragedy where the audience the rabble and royalty equally entertained pure gratuitous cinema and the director krishna vamsi must have had dream good time throwing every trick the book perhaps the all important message violence begetting violence and the inspiring extents motherly love were not the thoughts mind but came out watching shakti exhilarated making movies can the most fun the world
