he matrix certainly neo could have dispatched the clones much quicker and more efficiently again such acts lend themselves script hindered consistency and scenes created filler keep from feeling gypped jest our expectations the characters created the first film are discarded promptly sadly for those expecting more the same you will certainly walk away feeling gravely disappointed however you take reloaded your standard run the mill action movie and forget the incredible story inconsistencies and the untwining already established character development from the first film you should walk away feeling quite pleased
