1 |text can believe john died while filming episode collapsed set read this out his biography online john ritter was born burbank calafornia september 17th 1948 landed his last television role simple rules for dating teenage daughter 2002 based the popular book this sitcom played paul hennessey loving yet rational dad who laid down the ground rules for his three children the show was ratings winner its first season and won peoples choice award for best new comedy and also won for favorite comedy series the family awards while working simple rules also starred his second last film manhood 2003 that same year while john was rehearsing for the 4th 3rd series episode simple rules now shortened fell ill henry winkler described john looked like had food poisoning then collapsed the set was quickly rushed nearby hospital the same burbank hospital where was born was diagnosed with aorta dissection unrecognized heart flaw underwent surgery but did not make john ritter died age just week away from his 55th birthday leaving his wife amy yasbeck and children
