1 |text all honesty someone told the director lemony snicket series unfortunate events city angels and caspers was going neat little low budget indie film and that real good say that person must joking but that what director brad siberling did and was really good items less has similar conceit films like before sunrise lost translation more recently once involves the chance meeting two people who serendipity didn put them there they probably never cross paths they did they wouldn say word one each other like those films items less focuses the relationship that builds and how the characters come understand each other and build each other strengths and weaknesses the story involves morgan freeman playing unnamed actor who goes research his role grocery store employee for upcoming independent movie and because things beyond his control ends spending the day with the lady the items less lane played paz vega she has rotten marriage and hoping land new job secretary initially freeman character just needs lift home after spending time with her however wants get know her and maybe even offer her some advice brad siberling builds the characters almost entirely through the exchanges between freeman and vega the plot merely setup for these two characters interact with each other for most the film minute duration freeman has fun with his character appears outsider lower class world that vega character scarlett inhabits vega the meantime grows beyond the stubborn checkout clerk upset with her life situation looking move there couple things that really stood out this film first all siberling has probably taken note from independent cinema make sure the relationship sincere and doesn fall into any hollywood pitfalls very mutual friendship that develops convincingly throughout the film works even though the situation itself does seem little inconceivable also impressed with the performances while freeman presence gives this film credibility from the get shows certain amount charm and fun not usually seen from him paz vega meanwhile priming herself for breakthrough film sometime the future loved her spanglish and she equally good here the tough nonsense scarlet towards the end the film she successfully conveys the growth her character looking forward seeing her more films overall items less functions best character piece well scripted and directed brad siberling hasn done much writing and his feature film work has consisted mostly big hollywood films yet there certainly artist work here and anxious see take this road again
