1 |text foxes serious look the consequences growing too fast the 1980s and unlike the teen sex comedies that overshadowed porky fast times ridgement high the movie holds well against time its theme teen angst relevant today was years ago and jodie foster and sk8er boi scott baio remember him lead fine young cast that well worth watching the film follows four southern california girls they move through rootless existence sex and drugs and devoid parents the teens spend their days and out school and their nights parties concerts out the street seldom are they home because instant gratification pill party boy away but rather than condemning them the film sympathetic blaming absent uncaring adults for forcing the teens grow alone and the charismatic cast impossible dislike the film opening xc2 x96 long and loving pan sets the tone for what follows see the girls asleep daybreak amid the objects that define teen girlhood from twinkies picture young john travola while donna summer the radio scored beneath from there the movie picks speed the girls head off school and life annie runaway rocker cherie currie the wild child who lives for the next party pill deirdre kandice stroh the boy crazy drama queen madge marlilyn stroh the shy girl over her head and foster the one with the plan her job keep this crew together long enough finish high school while also holding her divorced and desperate man hunting mother line sally kellerman almost impossible job and one that foster ultimately fails despite its age foxes remains pleasure watch dated hair clothes and references olympic skater dorothy hamill haven hurt the movie the cinematography simply stunning with breathtaking filtered shots the basin dawn dusk and night giorgio moroder adds 80s soundtrack featuring the likes donna summer and janis ian perhaps the movie biggest disappointment that the young stars around foster never broke out like the casts elmo fire 1985 empire records 1995 foxes shows why they should have but perhaps like bowling for soup song 1985 they just hit wall
