1 |text there have been race pictures almost from the beginnings the movie business films starring almost entirely black casts have been made segregated poverty row studios more often than not owned caucasians for ghetto theaters with the growing urban blight during the 1970s this idea was revived with wave blaxploitation pictures made for urban grind houses which overlaid black actors and funky atmosphere over traditional movie plots this trend even spread into horror features with titles like blacula blackenstein and sugar hill serving blaxploitation versions monster standards and didn die with the closing most urban theaters xc2 x96 just slowly eased into the video age and continues with low budget direct dvd releases like this one and jose quiroz hood the living dead adopts the recent popularity horror movies for the hip hop audience ricky carl washington young scientist oakland trying keep his younger brother jermaine brandon daniels out trouble after the death their parents after jermaine shot drug dealers drive ricky decides use the experimental cell regenerating formula been working attempt save the teen life apparently his efforts are for naught and jermaine body taken away however the body never makes the morgue xc2 x96 jermaine animates the coroner van flesh hungry zombie kills the drivers then goes after the gang that killed him spreading the zombie infection wherever goes having heard from jermaine friends kevin derek taylor and marco raul martinez about the attack the gangsters ricky feels that the only thing capture jermaine and try cover the whole matter before and his accomplice scott chris angelo get arrested for the mayhem they caused however they soon find that the contagion spreading too fast for them control keeping things simple the quiroz team manages produce entertaining little horror feature without overextending themselves the point where things start look shoddy along the way they also add few interesting bits business when first confronted with zombie scott tells ricky shoot him the head like the movies xc2 x96 effective any way discover how kill zombies extra twist added when the first head shot doesn kill the brain adding viewer unease another good point that the soundtrack makes only limited use sub eminem style rap laying standard creepy music throughout
