1 |text titanic long but well made tragic adventure love story that takes place during the ill fated voyage the unsinkable ship writer director james cameron has done great job making this movie about fictional love story between two very different people and combining that with the real event the titanic that sunk after hitting iceberg april 1912 claiming thousands lives who perished the icy freeing waters the north atlantic the two leads the film are great their roles including leonardo dicaprio and kate winslet they make for good screen couple dicpario and winslet also had genuine chemistry together which made the romance that eventually blossoms between them that much more believable they both showed real talent when this one came out and both them have continued show just that their most recently films well the rest the supporting cast including billy zane kathy bates frances fisher jonathan hyde and bill paxton small role are equally impressive their characters who help bring them life this film the love story the action suspense and the special effects are magnificent done especially for that time the horror the situation the characters were felt real because really happened making you want most them survive this life and death situation the pacing was little slow times and was little long but the rest the movie made for few flaws titanic makes for great date movie which sure make some girls cry almost every time they watch the fact that this really happened definitely added the movie making you feel sorry for all the lives lost when the titanic sunk into the atlantic after hitting iceberg overall titanic tragic heartbreaking story about two people who fall love while the ill fated ship thats brought life the exceptional performances from the cast especially dicaprio and winslet who definitely make this movie worth the time watch
