nly drawback ismail darbar music which fails rise above the script the only saving grace the sexy item number ishq kameena which has been composed anu malik another pat for the director comes because has extracted some splendid performances from his cast karisma kapoor the life the film and has given moving performance helpless mother she sure win awards for this heated portrayal second actor nana patekar who back with bang with this film his uncouth mannerisms suit him the hilt and shown his versatility once again with this role sanjay kapoor the surprise packet the film with sincere and effective portrayal that stands against both the other actors deepti naval too top form and her climax showdown with nana praiseworthy shahrukh cameo provides the lighter moments and surely been pulled get the required star value though his role was not really required done well overall shakti far superior film than most churned out these days and the release hype sure get good opening shakti sure get the critics and audience thumps what the film needs desperately trimmed least reels better the impact shakti still has the power without hitch
