er the gaze the time her poses cross over into the realm soft core she has found way combine her need respected with the objectification she has been accustomed her whole life mary harron bettie page woman who yearns for control over her life and destiny yet ultimately always being told where stand how smile and what wear when she finally realizes that none her choices have been her own she chooses embrace god and preach his word those who will listen the true sadness behind this most important decision that she still letting someone else guide her blindly she just has more faith that this direction will better for her soul
