k behind them and stab them nearly silently your inventory you can get less than four weapons and two keys more about the weapons later the keys unlock certain doors most doors the game aren locked only two kinds need keys and these keys are only introduced later levels you restart levels resetting weaponry health score and lives each chapter much the later game spent looking for them now just alluded this game like many the period late early based collecting extra lives personally think completely and utterly useless was mercifully dropped from here end think from the next shooter and onwards since you can save anytime you want and using life resets weaponry health and ammo like starting new chapter which real pain later levels where you need heavier artillery now shall beat around the bush longer moving the guns you start with aforementioned knife which silent but only effective close and pistol nothing special but good for conserving ammo unlike the next two bad boys your third weapon german smg sub machine gun faster and automatic and some later enemies use and the last one nothing short gatling gun yeah think think predator think about unloading massive amounts lead into nazi fiends with such gun every bit entertaining sounds most the boss enemies use this though prepared won reveal the identities these boss enemies however that for each player discover for him her self the sound excellent very crisp and realistic you hear the tear machine gun firing the deafening metallic clank door slamming shut behind you nazi yelling surprised warning german you truly feel like you are there trapped these dark and depressing bunker systems that segues nicely into the level design you run through seemingly countless nearly identical hallways towards the next elevator leading you further you are grasped the claustrophobic mood almost got motion sickness more than once though that might also have something with little sleep lots humidity and unusual warmth from playing though the level detail isn terribly high what there great remains victims guards quarters and countless nazi symbols the list goes the game also features quite bit gore for limited graphics engine john romero and crew certainly put all the blood and guts that they could for the game what there left say the first its kind and wonder this spawned countless others shooters sure weapon bobbing and different height levels stairs and such didn come around until the next entry into the genre doom and was duke nukem that introduced the feature switching your view goes beyond simply left and right adding vertical dimensions and jumping didn come around until third later title the first quake possibly fellow gamers help out here but all those games well the rest the genre owe their existence this one load the luger open the door enter the bunker and step into shoes deserves the recognition even maybe even especially nearly fifteen years after first appeared recommended this all fans games
