jameson nude make shots and chasey lain began acting characteristically like drugged out primadonna finally add insult injury the producers got cold feet just before the flick was about hit shelves and began talking editing and removing all the gore reports have said that they were unhappy about the copious amounts violence and they wanted trim scenes down would achieve rating veil course disagreed seeing how his entire synopsis was boosted its creatively graphic display eventually after months arguments the director parted company with warehouse productions and the feature was once again locked the vaults despite countless disruptions veil slasher opus still one the best genre pieces released since the new millennium the copy was sent was the pre release screener which was obviously test press without sound effects the complete soundtrack but still boasted few credible jump scares some superb cinematography and couple the goriest set pieces that seen for some time one guy disemboweled via his rectum before being strangled with his own intestine jenna jameson stripped naked and gutted unflinching close and chasey lain ends spilling her guts after unfortunate rescue attempt from her boyfriend richard grieco even though the murders are uncommonly gruesome samhain never feels mean spirited which basically due the characters being thinly portrayed basic slasher clich xc3 xa9s all honesty the script was perhaps the movies biggest downfall because the dialogue was not much inspired wes craven scream movies was flagrantly cut and pasted from them certainly the inclusion the mouth watering jenna jameson was great move the producers her fans will excited know that she does whip off her top expected and does chasey lain and taylor hayes but samhain soft porn movie and benefits from sticking the structure that set out produce worth noting that the aforementioned xxx stars almost out perform the supposed actors the feature which isn much complement ginger lynn was least notable you ignore the shameful oirish accent and her battle with the hulking killer was superbly performed and choreographed alan chou taylor and jenna delivered expectedly poor dramatics which could have been caused the numerous problems set veil direction the cinematography was excellently constructed and provides some much needed injections suspense exciting and crisp photography mixed with good flair for storytelling and the net result slasher extravaganza satisfy even the most critical gore hounds will interesting see what kind final cut released samhain rumor has that second director was drafted shoot different ending and curious how much the explicit gore will remain intact for worldwide distribution the end result only half good the rough print that watched then still better than nearly all the genre pieces that have been unleashed over the past ten years this one certainly worth checking out xc2 x85
